Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.88,0:00:49.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你左边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.92,0:01:01.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你左边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On your left.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.20,0:01:04.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左边 我知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh-huh, on my left. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.03,0:01:11.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说了 你别说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't say it! Don't you say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.47,0:01:12.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你左边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On your left!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.17,0:01:13.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么还说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.90,0:01:22.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要叫医生吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Need a medic?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.12,0:01:27.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要换肺了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a new set of lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.96,0:01:31.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚刚半小时跑了13英里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, you just ran like thirteen miles in thirty minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.49,0:01:32.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来我是起晚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I got a late start.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.63,0:01:33.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.58,0:01:35.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真不害臊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should be ashamed of yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.26,0:01:36.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再跑一圈去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should take another lap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.96,0:01:39.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经跑完了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you just take it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.04,0:01:40.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是又跑了一圈吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I assumed you just took it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.48,0:01:41.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是哪个部队的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What unit are you with?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.59,0:01:43.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,58师 空降救援部队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fifty-eighth, Para-rescue.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.49,0:01:46.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我现在在退伍军人服务处工作 山姆·威尔逊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But now I'm working down at the V.A. Sam Wilson.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.73,0:01:47.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史蒂夫·罗杰斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steve Rogers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.65,0:01:48.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我猜得出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I kind of put that together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.71,0:01:51.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解冻之后回家一看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must have freaked you out,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.52,0:01:53.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是把你吓坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}coming home after the whole defrosting thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.38,0:01:55.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是得慢慢习惯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It takes some getting used to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.24,0:01:57.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很高兴认识你 山姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's good to meet you, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.00,0:01:59.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是床的问题 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's your bed, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.13,0:02:00.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.06,0:02:02.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的床 太软了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your bed, it's too soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.85,0:02:04.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我服役时 就躺在地上睡觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I was over there I sleep on the ground
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.45,0:02:06.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿石头当枕头 像原始人一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and used rock for pillows, like a caveman.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.89,0:02:09.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我回家了 躺在床上 就像...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now I'm home, lying in my bed, and it's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.89,0:02:11.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,躺在棉花糖上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lying on a marshmallow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.23,0:02:12.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉自己快沉到地上去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like I'm gonna sink right to the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.36,0:02:15.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.93,0:02:16.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两次派驻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two tours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.69,0:02:19.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你肯定很怀念以前的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must miss the good old days, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.35,0:02:22.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实现在还好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, things aren't so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.99,0:02:25.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吃的强多了 以前只会煮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Food's a lot better, we used to boil everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.50,0:02:28.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小儿麻痹能治愈了 互联网 真厉害\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No polio is good. Internet, so helpful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.29,0:02:30.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在网上看了好多东西 想跟上时代\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been reading that a lot trying to catch up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.83,0:02:35.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马文·盖伊 1972年《黑手煞星》的原声碟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Marvin Gaye, 1972, "Trouble Man" soundtrack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.87,0:02:38.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你错过的事 这专辑里面都有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything you've missed jammed into one album.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.52,0:02:39.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我加到清单里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll put it on the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.76,0:02:44.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.31,0:02:48.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(有任务 立即动身 路边见)
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.07,0:02:51.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山姆 我有任务了 谢谢你跟我一起跑步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, Sam, duty calls. Thanks for the run.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.23,0:02:52.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你那也叫跑步的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If that's what you wanna call running.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.67,0:02:53.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非这么损我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, that's how it is?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.51,0:02:55.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 就这样 - 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, that's how it is. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.55,0:02:58.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你哪天想去退伍军人服务处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any time you wanna stop by the V.A,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.22,0:03:01.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让前台的姑娘对我刮目相看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}make me look awesome in front of the girl at the front desk,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.21,0:03:02.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,提前通知我一声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.32,0:03:03.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,记下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll keep it in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.44,0:03:04.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.18,0:03:09.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小伙子们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, fellas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.99,0:03:11.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁知道怎么去史密森尼博物馆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Either one of you know where the Smithsonian is?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.83,0:03:13.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要去接一块化石\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here to pick up a fossil.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.77,0:03:14.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's hilarious.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.20,0:03:20.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.02,0:03:23.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是哪儿都能跑去的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't run everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.63,0:03:24.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.56,0:03:32.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(印度洋)
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.42,0:03:34.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标是一个移动卫星发射平台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The target is a mobile satellite launch platform:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.70,0:03:35.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷姆利亚星号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Lemurian Star.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.90,0:03:37.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,93分钟前 海盗登船时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was sending up their last payload
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.53,0:03:40.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们正在发射最后一颗卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when pirates took them, ninety-three minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.91,0:03:40.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.46,0:03:41.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对方有什么要求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any demands?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.21,0:03:42.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,15亿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A billion and a half.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.21,0:03:43.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么要这么多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why so steep?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.37,0:03:44.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为是神盾局的船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because it S.H.I.E.L.D's.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.31,0:03:48.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以不是偏离航向 是非法入侵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So it's not off course, it's trespass.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.27,0:03:49.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们肯定有理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure they have a good reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.76,0:03:51.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有点厌倦了总给弗瑞擦屁股\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I'm getting a little tired of being Fury's janitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.67,0:03:53.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放松 没那么复杂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Relax, it's not that complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.79,0:03:54.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有多少海盗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How many pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.99,0:03:55.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,25个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty-five,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.12,0:03:59.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,顶级雇佣兵 由乔治·巴托克带领\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}top mercs, led by this guy. Georges Batroc.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.77,0:04:01.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前对外安全总局行动部的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ex-DGSE, Action Division.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.99,0:04:04.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国际刑警"红色通缉令"头号通缉犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's at the top of Interpol's "red notice".
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.54,0:04:05.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被法国遣散前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before the French demobilized him,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.91,0:04:07.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他执行过36次击杀任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he had thirty-six kill missions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.63,0:04:09.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就擅长大开杀戒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This guy's got a rep for maximum casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.78,0:04:10.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人质呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hostages?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.79,0:04:11.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大都是技术人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mostly techs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.10,0:04:14.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一名官员 贾斯珀·西特韦尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One officer, Jasper Sitwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.73,0:04:15.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都在厨房\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're in the galley.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.99,0:04:17.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西特韦尔在发射船上做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's Sitwell doing on a launch ship?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.64,0:04:19.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 我搜索甲板 找到巴托克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, I'm gonna sweep the deck and find Batroc.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.49,0:04:21.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小娜 你关掉引擎等待命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nat, you'll kill the engines and wait for instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.64,0:04:24.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朗姆洛 你负责船尾 找到人质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rumlow, you sweep aft, find the hostages,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.32,0:04:26.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带他们上救生艇 救走他们 出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}get them to life pods. Get 'em out. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.15,0:04:27.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突击队 听到了吧 准备行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}S.T.R.I.K.E, you heard the Captain. Gear up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.52,0:04:42.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七频道确认安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Secure channel seven.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.43,0:04:43.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Seven secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.76,0:04:45.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,周六晚上找乐子了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You do anything fun Saturday night?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.51,0:04:49.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以前男声四重唱的伙伴都死光了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, all the guys from my barbershop quartet are dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.05,0:04:50.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以 没找成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so...no, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.84,0:04:52.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上进入跳伞区域 队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coming up by the drop zone, Cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.29,0:04:55.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你约统计部的克里斯汀试试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, if you ask Kristen out, from Statistics,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.45,0:04:56.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她可能会同意呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she'll probably say yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.04,0:04:58.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我才不约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's why I don't ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:02.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太害羞还是太害怕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too shy or too scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.35,0:05:03.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是太忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Too busy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.31,0:05:06.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他戴降落伞了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was he wearing a parachute?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.00,0:05:09.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 没戴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. No, he wasn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.87,0:07:06.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要动 不要动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move! Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.50,0:07:10.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.29,0:07:12.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不用谢 这不是看你没我挺无助的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. You seemed pretty helpless without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.75,0:07:18.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住你对门的护士怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the nurse that lives across the hall from you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.60,0:07:19.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她好像人不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She seems kind of nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:21.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先搞定轮机舱 再给我做红娘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Secure the engine room, then find me a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.63,0:07:23.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我能一心多用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm multitasking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.52,0:07:27.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟巴托克说了 想要神盾局付钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said to Batroc, if we want SHIELD to pay,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.65,0:07:29.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就得杀几个人给他们看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we have to start sending bodies now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.69,0:07:33.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就准备杀一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have a bullet for someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.58,0:07:36.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想吃枪子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want a bullet in your head?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.12,0:07:38.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收好腿 想吃枪子吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move that leg. Want a bullet in your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.51,0:07:48.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不喜欢等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't like waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.83,0:07:51.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打给杜兰德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call Durand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.52,0:07:54.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,救援一来就开船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want the ship ready to go as soon as the rescue arrives.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.00,0:07:55.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是 巴托克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, Batroc.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.66,0:08:04.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杜兰德 启动引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Durand. Start the engine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.26,0:08:04.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.24,0:08:08.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 水手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, sailor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.08,0:08:33.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴 怎么回事 想当英雄吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up. What is it? Want to be a hero?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.43,0:08:40.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可等够了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I've waited long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.05,0:08:46.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找巴托克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, look for Batroc.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.76,0:08:48.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两分钟内不回话 我就开始杀人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I do not hear in two minutes, I'll start to kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.77,0:08:50.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 我去找他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. I'll find him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.43,0:09:00.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.58,0:09:33.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴托克 神盾局的没回应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Radio silence from S.H.I.E.L.D, Batroc.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.34,0:09:39.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Targets acquired.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.01,0:09:41.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突击队就位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}S.T.R.I.K.E in position.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.16,0:09:43.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娜塔莎 你那边情况如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Natasha, what's your status?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.96,0:09:46.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娜塔莎 汇报情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Status, Natasha?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.18,0:09:47.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.30,0:10:05.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,轮机舱搞定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engine room secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.21,0:10:17.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间到了 谁想先死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time's up. Who wants to die first?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.62,0:10:21.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你 抓那个女的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you! Take the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.40,0:10:25.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听我命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On my mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.70,0:10:30.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三 二 一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three. Two. One.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.88,0:10:38.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说过 神盾局从不谈判\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you, S.H.I.E.L.D doesn't negotiate.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.41,0:10:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂 巴托克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello? Batroc,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.59,0:10:45.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边没回应 联系不上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the line is dead. I lost contact with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.76,0:10:47.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.30,0:11:01.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人质正在撤退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hostages enroute to extraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.48,0:11:04.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗曼诺夫没有来碰头 队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Romanoff missed the rendezvous point, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.17,0:11:07.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,敌方仍在反抗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hostiles are still in play.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.45,0:11:09.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娜塔莎 巴托克逃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Natasha, Batroc's on the move.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.90,0:11:12.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,绕回朗姆洛那里 保护人质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Circle back to Rumlow and protect the hostages.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.92,0:11:13.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娜塔莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Natasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.45,0:11:52.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是光靠盾吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought that you were more than just a shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.33,0:12:07.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试试便知\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.84,0:12:35.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真尴尬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, this is awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.64,0:12:39.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.08,0:12:41.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,备份硬盘数据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Backing up the hard drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.14,0:12:42.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是个好习惯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a good habit to get into.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.41,0:12:44.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朗姆洛需要你帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rumlow needed your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.27,0:12:45.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在这干什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.32,0:12:50.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在挽救神盾局情报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're saving S.H.I.E.L.D intel.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.71,0:12:51.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽可能多救点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever I can get my hands on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.98,0:12:53.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的任务是救人质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our mission is to rescue hostages.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.62,0:12:55.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 那是你的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. That's your mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.40,0:12:58.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你完成得很出色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you've done it beautifully.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.47,0:13:01.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你威胁了整个行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just jeopardized this whole operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.32,0:13:03.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你太夸张了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think that's overstating things.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.77,0:13:23.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 这次怪我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. That one's on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.61,0:13:25.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是怪你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You damn right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.34,0:13:46.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(神盾局三曲翼总部)
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.31,0:13:57.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就是没法不撒谎 是不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You just can't stop yourself from lying, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.26,0:14:00.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没撒谎 罗曼诺夫特工的任务和你不同\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't lie. Agent Romanoff had a different mission than yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.11,0:14:01.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就没觉得有必要跟我说吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which you didn't feel obliged to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.88,0:14:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不必非要做任何事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not obliged to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.67,0:14:05.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人质因此面临生命威胁 尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those hostages could've died, Nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.22,0:14:07.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我派了有史以来最棒的士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I sent the greatest soldier in history
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.23,0:14:08.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去救他们的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to make sure that didn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.81,0:14:11.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,士兵需要相互信任 才能组成一支军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soldiers trust each other, that's what makes it an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.36,0:14:12.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而不是一伙儿人乱开枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not a bunch of guys running around and shooting guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.94,0:14:14.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上次我信任了别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last time I trusted someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.70,0:14:16.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就丢了只眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I lost an eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.56,0:14:20.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想给你分配你不愿做的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I didn't want you doing anything you weren't comfortable with.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.70,0:14:23.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗曼诺夫特工没有不愿做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agent Romanoff is comfortable with everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.05,0:14:24.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,手下的人各行其是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't lead a mission
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.53,0:14:26.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你叫我怎么带队执行任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when the people I'm leading have missions of their owns.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.46,0:14:28.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那叫各司其职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's called compartmentalization.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.27,0:14:32.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人泄露秘密 因为大家都只知道一部分\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody spills the secrets because nobody knows them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.82,0:14:33.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Except you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.00,0:14:39.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看错我了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're wrong about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.00,0:14:41.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do share.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.52,0:14:43.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我是大好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm nice like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.10,0:14:47.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洞察计划舰湾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Insight bay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.08,0:14:49.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗杰斯队长没有洞察计划的权限\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Rogers does not have clearance for Project Insight.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.40,0:14:49.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.69,0:14:52.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼古拉斯·J·弗瑞局长授权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Director override, Fury, Nicholas J.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.72,0:14:54.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.50,0:14:58.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前电梯还放音乐的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, they used to play music.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.00,0:14:59.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.10,0:15:03.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爷爷当了40年电梯操作员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My grandfather operated one of these things for forty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.86,0:15:06.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他工作的大楼挺不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My granddad worked in a nice building,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.48,0:15:07.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小费拿的不少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he got good tips.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.10,0:15:09.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他晚上回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd walk home every night,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.54,0:15:12.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,午餐袋里能装一大卷一块钱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}roll of ones stuffed in his lunch bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.47,0:15:15.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他跟人问好 别人也回应\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd say "Hi", people would say hi back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.59,0:15:19.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来 世风日下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time went on, neighborhood got rougher.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.52,0:15:22.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他再问好 别人说 少废话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd say "Hi", they'd say, "Keep on steppin'".
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.90,0:15:25.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他得时刻小心自己的午餐袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Granddad got to grippin' that lunch bag a little tighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.15,0:15:27.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他被抢过吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he ever get mugged?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.99,0:15:31.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每周都有小混混问他 袋子里有啥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Every week some punk would say, "What's in the bag?"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.12,0:15:32.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他怎么办呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what did he do?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.96,0:15:34.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他们看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He'd show 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.81,0:15:39.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一堆破旧的一块钱 还有把上膛的.22马格南\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bunch of crumpled ones and loaded 0.22 Magnum.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.21,0:15:48.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我爷爷喜欢别人 只是不太相信别人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Granddad loved people. But he didn't trust them very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.08,0:15:58.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 是比马格南大了点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I know. They're a little bit bigger than a 0.22.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.42,0:16:35.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是洞察计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Project Insight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.23,0:16:37.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三台新一代天空航母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three next generation helicarriers
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.51,0:16:40.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,与定位卫星网络同步\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}synced to a network of targeting satellites.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.43,0:16:42.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,雷姆利亚星号发射的卫星\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Launched from the Lemurian Star.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.41,0:16:45.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦上了天 就不用降落了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once we get them in the air they never need to come down.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.64,0:16:50.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新冲击引擎可以持续进行亚轨道飞行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Continuous suborbital flight courtesy of our new repulser engines.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.71,0:16:51.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯塔克设计的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stark?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.74,0:16:53.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他看了旧涡轮增压引擎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he had a few suggestions
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.28,0:16:56.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就给我们提了点建议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}once he got an up close look at our old turbines.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.60,0:16:58.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这些新远距精准定位武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These new long range precision guns
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.77,0:17:01.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一分钟能消灭一千名敌人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}can eliminate a thousand hostiles a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.52,0:17:03.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怖分子哪怕不露面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The satellites can read a terrorist's DNA
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.55,0:17:05.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卫星也能读取他的DNA\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before he steps outside his spider hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.49,0:17:09.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们能把许多威胁扼杀在摇篮里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We gonna neutralize a lot of threats before they even happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.42,0:17:11.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做了坏事的人才该受到惩罚吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought the punishment usually came after the crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.56,0:17:13.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不能等到别人做了坏事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can't afford to wait that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.18,0:17:13.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's "we"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.88,0:17:17.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纽约事件之后 我说服了世界安全理事会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After New York, I convinced the World Security Council
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.21,0:17:19.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们需要量子级精密威胁分析\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we needed a quantum surgeon threat analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.48,0:17:22.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次我们远远地走在前面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For once we're way ahead of the curve.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.39,0:17:26.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿枪指着所有人 你管这个叫保护吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By holding a gun at everyone on Earth and calling it protection.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.86,0:17:29.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我读过战略科学军团的文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, I read those SSR files.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.72,0:17:34.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最伟大的一代吗 你们干过些见不得人的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greatest generation? You guys did some nasty stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.38,0:17:36.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我们妥协了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, we compromised.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.46,0:17:38.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时会因为这个夜不能寐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sometimes in ways that made us not sleep so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.75,0:17:40.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们是为了人民的自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we did it so the people could be free.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.23,0:17:43.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这不叫自由 这是恐惧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't freedom, this is fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.52,0:17:47.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神盾局接受现实的世界 而不是我们理想的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}S.H.I.E.L.D takes the world as it is, not as we'd like it to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.29,0:17:48.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你早该\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's getting damn near past time
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.44,0:17:50.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白这一点了 队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for you to get with that program, Cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.38,0:17:53.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别抱太大希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't hold your breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.73,0:18:07.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(圣路易精神号)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.30,0:18:27.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(欢迎回来 队长)
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.69,0:18:29.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国家的偶像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A symbol to the nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.83,0:18:32.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界的英雄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A hero to the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.10,0:18:37.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国队长的故事是荣誉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The story of Captain America is one of honor,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.68,0:18:40.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勇气和牺牲的故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}bravery and sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.89,0:18:46.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.46,0:18:47.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽因身体状况不佳未能入伍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Denied enlistment due to poor health,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.14,0:18:49.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.37,0:18:50.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史蒂文·罗杰斯却被选中参与美国战争史上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steven Rogers was chosen for a program unique
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.64,0:18:52.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个独一无二的项目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the annals of American warfare.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.01,0:18:59.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也因此成为史上第一位超级士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One that would transform him into the world's first super soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.66,0:19:06.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这段珍贵影像里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In this rare footage,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.76,0:19:09.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家最爱的勇士 美国队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}everyone's favorite warrior, Captain America...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.20,0:19:10.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,历经了沙场的考验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Battle tested,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.10,0:19:13.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国队长与他的咆哮突击队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain America and his Howling Commandos
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.32,0:19:15.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,步步高升\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}quickly earned their stripes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.96,0:19:18.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的任务是瓦解九头蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their mission, taking down Hydra,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.78,0:19:20.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,危险的纳粹科研部门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Nazi rogue science division.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.26,0:19:24.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(牺牲的同志)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.11,0:19:26.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自儿时起便是挚友的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Best friends since childhood,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.03,0:19:30.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴基·巴恩斯和史蒂文·罗杰斯无论在校园里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bucky Barnes and Steven Rogers were inseparable
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.48,0:19:33.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是在战场上都形影不离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on both school yard and battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.79,0:19:36.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴恩斯是咆哮突击队中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Barnes is the only Howling Commando
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.52,0:19:40.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一一位为国捐躯的战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to give his life in service of his country.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.87,0:19:47.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那年冬天格外严酷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was a difficult winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.37,0:19:51.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.62,0:19:51.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一场暴风雪将半个营困在了德国战线之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A blizzard had trapped half our battalion behind the German line.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.83,0:19:54.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史蒂夫 罗杰斯队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steve... Captain Rogers,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.98,0:19:57.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他成功突破了压制盟军数月的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he fought his way through a Hydra blockade
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.71,0:20:00.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九头蛇防线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that had pinned our allies down for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.41,0:20:04.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他救了一千多人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He saved over a thousand men,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.95,0:20:07.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包括后来...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}including the man who would...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.87,0:20:10.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,后来成为我丈夫的这位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who would become my husband as it turned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.65,0:20:14.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至在他死后 史蒂夫也在改变着我的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even after he died, Steve was still changing my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.54,0:20:19.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该为自己骄傲 佩吉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should be proud of yourself, Peggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.22,0:20:29.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我活了一辈子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have lived a life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.31,0:20:34.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,唯一的遗憾是你没过上自己的生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My only regret is that you didn't get to live yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.14,0:20:39.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.76,0:20:44.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直以来 我的原则都是做正确的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For as long as I can remember I just wanted to do what was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.66,0:20:48.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我已经搞不太清什么是正确了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I'm not quite sure what that is anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.69,0:20:54.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为自己可以回归军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I thought I could throw myself back in
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.09,0:20:56.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,遵守命令 保家卫国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and follow orders, serve.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.77,0:21:01.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是已经不一样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just not the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.38,0:21:05.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你老是这么夸张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're always so dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.18,0:21:11.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你拯救了世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, you saved the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.11,0:21:18.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而我们 又给弄得一团糟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We rather...mucked it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.14,0:21:19.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.16,0:21:22.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我留下来 一半是因为听说你参与创办了神盾局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Knowing that you helped found S.H.I.E.L.D is half the reason I stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.70,0:21:33.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界已经变了 我们回不去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The world has changed and none of us can go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.11,0:21:36.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只能尽力做到最好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All we can do is our best,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.22,0:21:40.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而有时 最好的选择就是重新开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and sometimes the best that we can do is to start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.25,0:21:48.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佩吉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Peggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.13,0:21:56.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史蒂夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steve?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.42,0:22:01.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.58,0:22:04.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你...你回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You... you came, you came back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.70,0:22:05.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 佩吉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, Peggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.28,0:22:11.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's been so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.14,0:22:15.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So long.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.64,0:22:18.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我怎么能离开我的美人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I couldn't leave my best girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.29,0:22:21.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她还欠我一支舞呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not when she owes me a dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.49,0:22:28.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,封闭办公室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Secure office.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.57,0:22:39.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,打开雷姆利亚星号卫星发射文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open Lemurian Star satellite launch file.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.62,0:22:41.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拒绝访问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Access denied.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.21,0:22:44.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,运行解密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Run decryption.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.58,0:22:48.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解密失败\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Decryption failed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.67,0:22:51.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼古拉斯·J·弗瑞局长授权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Director override, Fury, Nicholas J.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.44,0:22:56.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,授权失败 文件全部封存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Override denied. All files sealed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.52,0:22:57.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On whose authority?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.08,0:23:00.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼古拉斯·J·弗瑞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fury, Nicholas J.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.07,0:23:07.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界安全理事会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}World Security Council.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.30,0:23:08.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.16,0:23:13.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果尼克·弗瑞觉得派他的扮装男\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If Nick Fury thinks he can get us costumed thugs
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.61,0:23:15.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和突击队处理好他惹的麻烦就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and S.T.R.I.K.E commandos to mop-up his mess,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.78,0:23:18.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那他是大错特错 此次失利不能容忍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's sadly mistaken. This failure is unacceptable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.41,0:23:20.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鉴于袭击就发生在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, considering this attack took place one mile
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.63,0:23:22.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我国海域一英里外\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}from my country's sovereign waters,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.23,0:23:24.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恐怕这样还不够 我提议立刻开听证会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's a bit more then that. I move for immediate hearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.95,0:23:26.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不需要听证会 需要行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't need hearings, we need action.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.82,0:23:29.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理事会的责任就是监管神盾局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's this Council's duty to oversee S.H.I.E.L.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.39,0:23:31.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样的失守引出了许多疑问\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A breach like this raises serious questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.48,0:23:33.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如一个法国海盗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like how the hell did a French pirate
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.27,0:23:37.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是怎么在光天化日下劫持了神盾局的机密军舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}manage to hijack a covert S.H.I.E.L.D vessel in broad daylight?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.35,0:23:38.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,申明一下 理事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For the record, councilman,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.53,0:23:39.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是阿尔及利亚人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he's Algerian.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.16,0:23:41.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要的话我可以画张地图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can draw a map if it'll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.10,0:23:45.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢你的指教 皮尔斯部长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I appreciate your wits, Secretary Pierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.62,0:23:46.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是本理事会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But this council take things
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.88,0:23:49.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对国际海盗问题的态度很严肃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}like international piracy fairly seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.41,0:23:50.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.83,0:23:52.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我倒不在乎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.91,0:23:55.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不在乎一船一舰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care about one boat,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.08,0:23:56.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在乎整个舰队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I care about the fleet.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.44,0:24:00.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果理事会遇到点小事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this council is going to fold a rancor every time
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.73,0:24:03.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就要大肆抱怨一番\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}someone pushes us on the playing field,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.35,0:24:06.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那或许也该找人监管我们了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe we need someone to oversee us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.01,0:24:08.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,部长先生 我们不是说...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Secretary, nobody is suggesting...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.07,0:24:13.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失陪一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.03,0:24:15.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又有麻烦了吗 部长先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More trouble, Mr. Secretary?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.84,0:24:17.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那要看你怎么定义麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It depends on your definition.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.44,0:24:27.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们办公室只隔了四十层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I work forty floors away
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.83,0:24:29.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没人劫船你都不肯来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it takes a hijacking for you to visit?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.55,0:24:31.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,核战爆发我也会来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, a nuclear war would do it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.96,0:24:33.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忙吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Busy in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.25,0:24:36.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用钱都能解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing some earmarks can't fix.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.89,0:24:41.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是来找你帮忙的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm here to ask a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.90,0:24:43.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我希望你能组织一次投票\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to call for a vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.03,0:24:46.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洞察计划需要延后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Project Insight has to be delayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.72,0:24:48.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼克 这不是小忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick, that's not a favor,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.94,0:24:50.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这需要小组委员会开慢长的听证会\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's a subcommittee hearing. A long one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.59,0:24:52.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或许也没什么问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It could be nothing, probably is nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.71,0:24:55.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我得确保万无一失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just need time to make sure it's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.43,0:24:56.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有问题呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if it's something?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.42,0:24:57.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我们都该庆幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then we'll both be damn glad
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.72,0:24:59.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没把天空航母送上天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}those Helicarriers aren't in the air.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.98,0:25:02.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.25,0:25:06.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但你得让钢铁侠参加我侄女的生日派对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you gotta get Iron Man to stop by my niece's birthday party.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.27,0:25:08.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.87,0:25:11.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,路过不算数 得好好玩会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And not just a fly-by, he's got to mingle.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.71,0:25:17.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题是 我觉得情况在恶化\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The thing is I think it's getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.69,0:25:21.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,上周一个警察叫停了我的车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A cop pulled me over last week,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.76,0:25:22.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他以为我喝醉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he thought I was drunk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.18,0:25:27.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我急转弯 想躲一个塑料袋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I swerved to miss a plastic bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.24,0:25:30.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我以为那是简易炸弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it was an IED.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.14,0:25:34.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些东西被留在了那边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some stuff you leave there,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.36,0:25:37.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些东西被带了回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}other stuff you bring back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.63,0:25:40.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想好要怎么承担是我们的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's our job to figure out how to carry it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.65,0:25:42.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是装在箱子里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it gonna be in a big suitcase
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.27,0:25:44.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是放在钱包里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or in a little man-purse?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.04,0:25:47.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,取决于你自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.32,0:25:49.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下周见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll see you next week.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.67,0:25:54.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是跑步小能手吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look who it is. The running man.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.82,0:25:57.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听到了最后几分钟 讲得真好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Caught the last few minutes. It's pretty intense.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.44,0:25:58.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.58,0:26:00.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都有一样的问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we all got the same problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.14,0:26:03.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愧疚 悔恨\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guilt, regret.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.58,0:26:05.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你失去了亲近的人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You lose someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.79,0:26:09.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的僚机莱利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My wingman, Riley.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.15,0:26:11.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,夜间飞行任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fly in the night mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.50,0:26:13.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,标准的空降救援任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A standard PJ rescue op,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.99,0:26:16.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,演练过几千次的事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nothing we hadn't done a thousand times before,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.37,0:26:19.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可是一枚火箭弹击中了莱利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}till RPG knock Riley's dumb ass out of the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.91,0:26:25.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么也做不了 只能眼睁睁看着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing I could do. It's like I was up there just to watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.07,0:26:27.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.97,0:26:28.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After that,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.14,0:26:32.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我纠结了好一阵寻找一个留在那的理由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had really hard time finding a reason for being over there, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.67,0:26:37.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但回归正常生活还是开心的吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you're happy now, back in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.42,0:26:39.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在对我发号施令的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, the number of people giving me orders
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.26,0:26:41.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经...没有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is down to about zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.20,0:26:43.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.16,0:26:45.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想退出吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You thinking about getting out?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.01,0:26:47.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.94,0:26:50.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.72,0:26:54.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话 我都不知道退出了还能干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To be honest, I don't know what I would do with myself if I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.05,0:26:56.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去终极格斗吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ultimate fighting?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.50,0:26:58.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一下子就想到了这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a great idea off the top of my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.94,0:27:01.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但说真的 你想干什么都行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But seriously, you could do whatever you want to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.66,0:27:03.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What makes you happy?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.51,0:27:06.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.59,0:27:11.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启动通讯加密程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Activating communications encryption protocol.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.56,0:27:13.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接通安全线路0405\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open secure line zero-four-zero-five.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.45,0:27:15.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.07,0:27:17.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是希尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.85,0:27:22.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你来华盛顿 情况严重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need you here in D.C. Deep shadow conditions.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.41,0:27:24.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我四小时到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me four hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.66,0:27:26.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给你三小时 完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have three, over.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.60,0:27:43.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要查我证件吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Want to see my lease?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.97,0:28:03.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发现骨折\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fracture detected.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.47,0:28:08.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,建议注射麻醉剂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Recommend anesthetic injection.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.45,0:28:17.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,调度显示附近并无大都市警察\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}D.C. Metropolice dispatch shows no units in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.19,0:28:22.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快离开这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.77,0:28:27.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动力系统失效\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Propulsion systems offline.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.52,0:28:28.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就快他妈重启\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then reboot, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.85,0:28:30.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(外壳完整性 83%)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.31,0:28:30.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(外壳完整性 82%)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.77,0:28:31.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(外壳完整性 81%)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.23,0:28:31.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(外壳完整性 80%)
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.98,0:28:51.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警告 车窗已受损\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warning! Window integrity compromised.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.20,0:28:52.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.75,0:28:56.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要多久启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How long to propulsion?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.21,0:28:58.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,计算中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calculating.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.14,0:29:03.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车窗完整性 31%\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Window Integrity thiry-one percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.47,0:29:04.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,调用反制措施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deploying counter measures.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.60,0:29:05.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先等下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold that order!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.21,0:29:09.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车窗完整性 19%\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Window Integrity nineteen percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.68,0:29:11.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 建议启动反制措施 - 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Offensive measures advised. - Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.29,0:29:17.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车窗完整性 1%\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Window Integrity one percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.39,0:29:18.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.83,0:29:30.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动力系统已恢复\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Propulsion systems now online.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.85,0:29:32.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全速前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full acceleration, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.70,0:29:49.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,启动直升功能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Initiate vertical takeoff!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.30,0:29:50.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞行系统损坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Flight systems damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.63,0:29:52.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就打开导航摄像头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then activate guidance camera!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.41,0:29:57.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来控制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me the wheel!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.61,0:30:05.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给希尔特工打电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me Agent Hill.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.96,0:30:07.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通讯系统损坏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Communications array damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.81,0:30:09.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有好的地方吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, what's not damaged?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.12,0:30:11.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空调系统完全正常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Air conditioning is fully operational.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.22,0:30:24.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前方交通堵塞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Traffic ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.19,0:30:25.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就给我换条路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me an alternate route.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.28,0:30:27.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗斯福大桥上交通堵塞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Traffic alert on Roosevelt Bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.33,0:30:28.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有机动车禁行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All vehicles stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.70,0:30:32.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,17大道可行 正前方三个街区处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}17 Avenue clear in three blocks, directly ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.23,0:32:10.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警告 接近十字路口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Warning, approaching intersection.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.48,0:32:20.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我找条出路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get me off the grid!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.89,0:32:23.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前往安全区域路线计算中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Calculating route to secure location.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.78,0:33:40.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真好 太好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's so sweet. That is so nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.60,0:33:45.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得挂了 再见\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta go, though. Okay, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.84,0:33:49.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我姑妈 她有点失眠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My aunt, she's kind of an insomniac.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.53,0:33:51.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.09,0:33:54.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要是 不介意的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, if you want... if you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.91,0:33:56.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以用我的洗衣机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're welcome to use my machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.73,0:33:58.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该比地下室那个便宜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Might be cheaper than the one in the basement.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.24,0:34:00.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 有多便宜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah? What's it cost?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.57,0:34:02.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一杯咖啡怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A cup of coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.28,0:34:07.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 但是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, but
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.27,0:34:10.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经拿下去好多了 而且\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I already have a load in downstairs, and, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.51,0:34:13.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是别用你的洗衣机洗我的白大褂了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you really don't want my scrubs in your machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.23,0:34:14.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我刚换班\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm just finished rotation
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.76,0:34:16.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从传染病房回来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the infectious diseases ward, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.83,0:34:18.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我还是保持距离吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, well, I'll keep my distance.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.70,0:34:20.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希望不要太远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well hopefully not too far.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.78,0:34:24.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的音响好像忘记关了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and I think you left your stereo on.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.11,0:34:27.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh. Right, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.32,0:35:15.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我好像没给过你钥匙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't remember giving you a key.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.90,0:35:19.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你觉得我需要吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really think I'd need one?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.05,0:35:23.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我老婆把我赶出来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My wife kicked me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.23,0:35:26.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我都不知道你结婚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't know you were married.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.14,0:35:30.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不知道我的事多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are a lot of things you don't about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.96,0:35:32.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这我知道 尼克 问题就在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, Nick. That's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.79,0:35:45.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(隔墙有耳)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.41,0:35:49.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很抱歉我这样不请自来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry to have do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.12,0:35:50.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我真无处可去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I had no place else to crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.13,0:35:55.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(神盾局有问题)
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.29,0:35:59.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有谁知道你老婆的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who else knows about your wife?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.01,0:36:02.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(你和我)
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.50,0:36:03.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.13,0:36:07.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的朋友们吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.21,0:36:09.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们算朋友吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that what we are?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.49,0:36:11.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那取决于你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.21,0:36:34.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要相信任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't trust anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.95,0:36:37.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗杰斯队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Rogers?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.10,0:36:43.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长 我是神盾局特勤处13号特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, I'm Agent 13 of S.H.I.E.L.D's Special Service.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.22,0:36:44.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凯特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kate?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.14,0:36:47.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是被派来保护你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm assigned to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.29,0:36:48.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁派你来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On whose order?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.33,0:36:51.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.16,0:36:57.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,狐步受伤 已经失去知觉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Foxtrot is down, he's unresponsive.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.76,0:36:58.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请派遣急救人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need EMTs.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.71,0:37:00.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确认枪手的位置了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you have a twenty on the shooter?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.58,0:37:02.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉他们我去追了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell them I'm in pursuit.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.01,0:38:04.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他能挺过来吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is he gonna make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.37,0:38:05.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.38,0:38:08.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,杀手什么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me about the shooter.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.11,0:38:11.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动作快 很有劲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's fast and strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.98,0:38:15.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有一条金属臂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had a metal arm.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.68,0:38:21.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弹道分析\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ballistics?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.64,0:38:23.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三颗子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three slugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.85,0:38:25.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有膛线 完全无法追踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No rifling and completely untraceable.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.30,0:38:27.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前苏联制造的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Soviet made?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.66,0:38:29.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.17,0:38:29.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's dropping.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.88,0:38:32.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抢救车过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Crash cart coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.49,0:38:33.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,护士 请帮我塞纱布\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nurse, help me with the gauzes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.76,0:38:35.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 血压下降了 - 除颤器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- BP is dropping. - Defibrillator!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.23,0:38:39.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,充电至100焦耳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charge to one hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.67,0:38:41.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼克 你不能死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do this to me, Nick.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.28,0:38:45.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退后 三 二 一 离手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand back! Three, two, one. Clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.18,0:38:47.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有脉搏吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pulse?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.91,0:38:48.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No pulse.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.62,0:38:49.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 充电至200焦耳\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay. Charge to two hundred, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.02,0:38:53.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,退后 三 二 一 离手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand back! Three, two, one. Clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.80,0:38:56.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,注射肾上腺素 有脉搏吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me epinephrine! Pulse?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.14,0:38:57.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.01,0:39:03.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼克 你不能这样 不能死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do this to me, Nick. Don't do this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.01,0:39:23.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在几点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.65,0:39:25.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1:03 医生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}1:03, Doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.44,0:39:30.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死亡时间 凌晨1:03\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time of death, 1:03 A.M.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.44,0:40:08.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得带走他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.54,0:40:24.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娜塔莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Natasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.15,0:40:38.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娜塔莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Natasha!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.61,0:40:42.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗瑞怎么会去你家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why was Fury in your apartment?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.33,0:40:45.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.00,0:40:47.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长 他们叫你回神盾局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, they want you back at S.H.I.E.L.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.43,0:40:48.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 稍等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.41,0:40:49.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们让你立刻回去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They want you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.21,0:40:52.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.27,0:40:56.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你真不会说谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're a terrible liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.59,0:41:05.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突击队立刻护送罗杰斯队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}S.T.R.I.K.E team escort Captain Rogers
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.47,0:41:07.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,返回神盾局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}back to S.H.I.E.L.D immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.97,0:41:08.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟他说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told him.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.54,0:41:17.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.12,0:41:17.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.63,0:41:20.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突击队 出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}S.T.R.I.K.E, move it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.96,0:41:32.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论结果如何 你尽力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For whatever it's worth, you did your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.29,0:41:34.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢您 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.05,0:41:38.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗杰斯队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Rogers.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.02,0:41:38.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,邻居\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Neighbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.05,0:41:44.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长 我是亚历山大·皮尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, Captain. I'm Alexander Pierce.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.96,0:41:46.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官 很荣幸见到你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, it's an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.60,0:41:47.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感到荣幸的应该是我 队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The honor is mine, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.78,0:41:50.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我父亲是101空降师的 进来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father served in the 101st. Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.48,0:41:54.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那张照片是我和尼克认识五年后拍的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That photo was taken five years after Nick and I met,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.26,0:41:56.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那时我在哥伦比亚国务院\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when I was at State Department in Bogota.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.76,0:41:59.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥伦比亚民族解放军占领使馆后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ELN rebels took the embassy,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.49,0:42:01.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,警卫帮我逃了出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and security got me out,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.38,0:42:03.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是叛军抓走了人质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the rebels took hostages.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.21,0:42:07.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼克是神盾局当地站点的二把手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick was deputy chief for the S.H.I.E.L.D station there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.52,0:42:08.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他提出了一个计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And he comes to me with a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.15,0:42:11.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要通过下水道进行突袭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants to storm the building through the sewers.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.25,0:42:13.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说 不行 我们会谈判的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said, "No, we'll negotiate."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.94,0:42:16.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果是 叛军不跟我们谈判\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Turned out the ELN didn't negotiate,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.76,0:42:18.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是下令格杀勿论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so they put out a kill order.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.66,0:42:20.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们冲进了地下室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They stormed the basement,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.31,0:42:22.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果发现了什么呢 那里空了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and what did they find? They find it empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.62,0:42:25.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼克违抗了我的直接命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick had ignored my direct order
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.45,0:42:29.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在外国境内 擅自采取了军事行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and carried out an unauthorized military operation on foreign soil.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.84,0:42:32.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,营救了十几名政府官员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He saved the lives of a dozen political officers,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.31,0:42:33.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有我的女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}including my daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.56,0:42:34.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你提拔了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you gave him a promotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.10,0:42:37.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且从未后悔过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've never had any cause to regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.89,0:42:41.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长 尼克昨晚为什么去你家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, why was Nick in your apartment last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.19,0:42:46.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.61,0:42:48.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道那里被监听了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know it was bugged?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.79,0:42:51.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道 还是尼克告诉我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did, because Nick told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.58,0:42:54.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那他告诉你是他监听的了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he tell you he was the one who bugged it?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.84,0:43:03.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给你看样东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to see something.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.92,0:43:05.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴托克 是谁雇了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who hired you, Batroc?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.13,0:43:06.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是直播吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that live?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.78,0:43:08.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 他们昨晚在阿尔及尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, they picked him up last night
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.00,0:43:10.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一个不够安全的安全屋抓到了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in a not-so-safe house in Algiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.34,0:43:12.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说他是嫌犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you saying he's a suspect?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.81,0:43:14.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴托克可不做暗杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Assassination isn't Batroc's line.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.77,0:43:16.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是他 事情要更复杂些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's more complicated than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.13,0:43:18.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴托克受匿名人士雇佣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Batroc was hired anonymously
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.63,0:43:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,袭击雷姆利亚星号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to attack the Lemurian Star
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.47,0:43:21.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们通过电子邮件联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and he was contacted by e-mail
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.91,0:43:23.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用电汇付款\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and paid by wire transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.63,0:43:26.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之后这笔钱经过了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And then the money was run through
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.66,0:43:28.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,17个虚假账户转账\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}seventeen fictitious accounts,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.09,0:43:30.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后转给一家控股公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the last one going to a holding company
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.87,0:43:33.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公司注册者叫雅各布·维奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that was registered to a Jacob Veech.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.65,0:43:34.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我应该认识他吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I supposed to know who that is?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.02,0:43:37.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不应该 维奇六年前就死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not likely. Veech died six years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.23,0:43:38.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他最后的地址是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}His last address was
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.24,0:43:40.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,埃尔姆赫斯特大街1435号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}14-35 Elmhurst Drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.92,0:43:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我第一次见尼克时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I first met Nick
Dialogue: 0,0:43:41.99,0:43:43.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他母亲住在1437号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}his mother lived at 14-37.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.89,0:43:48.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的意思是弗瑞雇了海盗吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you saying Fury hired the pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.77,0:43:49.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.56,0:43:51.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大部分人的看法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well the prevailing theory
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.41,0:43:54.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是劫持事件只是在掩盖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was that the hijacking was a cover
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.28,0:43:58.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,机密情报的交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the acquisition and sale of classified intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.65,0:44:02.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交易出了岔 结果尼克送了命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The sale went sour and that led to Nick's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.57,0:44:06.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你真了解尼克·弗瑞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you really knew Nick Fury
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.90,0:44:08.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就该知道这不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know that's not true.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.61,0:44:10.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不然我为什么找你来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you think we're talking?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.29,0:44:16.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我在理事会工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, I took a seat on the Council
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.70,0:44:19.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是我愿意 而是应尼克的请求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not because I wanted to but because Nick asked me to,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.68,0:44:21.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我们都十分现实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because we were both realists.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.27,0:44:25.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们知道 除去那些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We knew that despite all the diplomacy
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.59,0:44:27.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外交手腕和官样文章\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the handshaking and the rhetoric,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.42,0:44:30.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想建立更美好的新世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that to build a really better world
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.50,0:44:34.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时需要摧毁旧世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}sometimes means having to tear the old one down.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.07,0:44:38.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而这样难免树敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And that makes enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.85,0:44:42.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们会说你无耻肮脏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those people that call you dirty
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.50,0:44:45.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你能狠下心做见不得人的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because you got the guts to stick your hands in the mud
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.07,0:44:46.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好创造更美好的事物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and try to build something better.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.73,0:44:50.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一想到那些人今天会拍手称快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the idea that those people could be happy today,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.11,0:44:54.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就让我非常恼火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}makes me really, really angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.78,0:45:00.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长 你是尼克生前见到的最后一人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain, you were the last one to see Nick alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.94,0:45:02.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为这绝非巧合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think that's an accident,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.44,0:45:05.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想你也这样觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I don't think you do either.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.30,0:45:08.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我再问你一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So I'm gonna ask again,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.65,0:45:10.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他为什么会去你那\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why was he there?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.26,0:45:15.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他告诉我不要相信任何人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He told me not to trust anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.59,0:45:20.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也包括他吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wonder if that included him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.84,0:45:28.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 那是他的遗言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. Those were his last words.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.26,0:45:31.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失陪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.80,0:45:35.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.28,0:45:39.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人杀害了我的朋友 我必须查明原委\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Somebody murdered my friend and I'm gonna find out why.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.51,0:45:43.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挡我路的 我都会让他后悔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone gets in my way, they're gonna regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.39,0:45:45.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.65,0:45:49.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明白\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.56,0:46:08.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行动控制中心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Operations control.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.30,0:46:10.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.13,0:46:14.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有突击队员准备就位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All S.T.R.I.K.E personal on site.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.41,0:46:15.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 明白 - 是 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Understood. - Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.68,0:46:16.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,鉴证处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forensics.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.72,0:46:18.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 确认 - 队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Confirmed. - Cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.29,0:46:20.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朗姆洛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rumlow.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.62,0:46:31.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,物证组在楼顶上发现了些纤维\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evidence response found some fibers on the roof
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.32,0:46:32.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想让我们去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they want us to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.21,0:46:33.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要让战术小队就绪吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You want me to get the tac-team ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.07,0:46:36.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先看看情况再说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, lets wait and see what it is first.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.26,0:46:37.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.79,0:46:50.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在什么情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the status so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.49,0:46:52.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行政层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Administrations level.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.66,0:46:53.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.82,0:46:54.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让让\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.41,0:47:05.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗瑞的事 我深表遗憾\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry about what happened with Fury.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.98,0:47:07.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是惨剧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Messed up what happened to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.15,0:47:09.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.52,0:47:29.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,档案室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Records.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.55,0:47:30.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.64,0:47:48.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动手之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before we get started,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.36,0:47:51.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有人想出去吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}does anyone want to get out?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.14,0:47:57.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(紧急停止)
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.39,0:48:27.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,派遣突击队至25楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mobilize S.T.R.I.K.E units, 25th floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.30,0:48:43.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别激动 大个子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Woh, big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.99,0:48:48.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就想说 队长 这不是针对你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just want you to know, Cap, this ain't personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.31,0:49:01.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉就是针对我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It kind of feels personal.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:09.70,0:49:11.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放下盾牌 举起双手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop the shield! Put your hands in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.08,0:49:29.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,投降吧 罗杰斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give it up, Rogers!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.09,0:49:30.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把门打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get that door open!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.11,0:49:32.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你无路可逃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have nowhere to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.34,0:49:53.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开什么玩笑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.46,0:49:56.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他往车库去了 封闭大桥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's headed for the garage. Lock down the bridge!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.22,0:50:10.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗杰斯队长 立刻投降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand down, Captain Rogers. Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:10.77,0:50:13.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重复 立刻投降\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Repeat, stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.18,0:50:50.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都听好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eyes here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.33,0:50:53.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无论手头上有什么事 都推掉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever your op is, bury it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.30,0:50:54.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在是一级戒备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is level one.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.04,0:50:58.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通知交通部 特区的路口全部亮红灯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Contact DOT. All traffic lights in the district go red.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.90,0:51:03.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,封锁附近机场所有跑道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut all runways at BWI, IAD and Reagan.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.12,0:51:04.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将市区里的所有监控摄像头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All security cameras in the city
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.64,0:51:06.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,调到这个显示屏上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}go through this monitor, right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.13,0:51:08.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追踪所有通讯设备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scan all open sources.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:08.86,0:51:12.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,电话 电脑 平板 能查的都查\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Phones, computers, PDA's, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.68,0:51:15.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人发推特提到他 我也要知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If someone Tweets about this guy, I want to know about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:15.76,0:51:16.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恕我直言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With all due respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.55,0:51:18.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果神盾局要追捕美国队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If S.H.I.E.L.D is conducting a manhunt for Captain America,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.56,0:51:19.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有权知道原因\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we deserve to know why.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:20.90,0:51:22.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为他骗了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because he lied to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:23.78,0:51:27.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗杰斯队长知道弗瑞局长之死的内情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain Rogers has information regarding the death of Director Fury,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.87,0:51:29.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,却不愿告诉我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he refused to share it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.47,0:51:33.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道大家很难接受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As difficult as this is to accept,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.59,0:51:36.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但美国队长现在是神盾局的逃犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain America is a fugitive from S.H.I.E.L.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.73,0:52:05.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 哪去了 - 安全的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is it? - Safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.75,0:52:06.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,具体点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do better!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.48,0:52:07.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你哪里弄来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.52,0:52:08.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,凭什么告诉你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would I tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.11,0:52:10.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗瑞为什么要给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fury gave it to you. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.27,0:52:12.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's on it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.01,0:52:12.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.68,0:52:13.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.78,0:52:16.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是摆出什么都知道的样子 罗杰斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I only act like I know everything, Rogers.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.07,0:52:19.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一定知道是弗瑞雇了海盗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I bet you knew Fury hired the pirates, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.99,0:52:20.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那倒是说得通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.60,0:52:23.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那艘船有问题 你和弗瑞都得想办法上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The ship was dirty, Fury needed a way in, so do you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.04,0:52:24.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别让我再问你第二遍\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna ask you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.20,0:52:27.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道是谁杀了弗瑞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know who killed Fury.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.36,0:52:33.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多数情报机构不相信他的存在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most of the intelligence community doesn't believe he exists,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.87,0:52:36.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,相信的称他为冬日战士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the ones who do call him the Winter Soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.95,0:52:39.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在过去的五十年里 他参与了二十多起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's credited with over two dozen assassinations
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.13,0:52:41.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,暗杀事件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the last fifty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.62,0:52:43.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那他是个鬼故事咯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he's a ghost story.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.60,0:52:46.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,五年前 我护送一个核武器工程师离开伊朗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five years ago I was escorting a nuclear engineer out of Iran,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.75,0:52:49.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快到敖德萨时 有人射穿了我的轮胎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}somebody shot at my tires near Odessa.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.20,0:52:53.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,车失控掉下悬崖 我们逃了出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We lost control, went straight over a cliff, I pulled us out,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.24,0:52:55.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但冬日战士也在那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the Winter Soldier was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.96,0:52:59.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,见我挡着 他就一枪打穿了我 杀了工程师\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was covering my engineer, so he shot him straight through me.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:00.78,0:53:05.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前苏联子弹 没有膛线 穿不了比基尼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Soviet slag, no rifling. Bye-bye bikinis.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.20,0:53:08.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在穿比基尼一定很丑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I bet you look terrible in them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.79,0:53:13.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追踪他是没用的 我试过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Going after him is a dead end. I know, I've tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:14.55,0:53:16.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像你说的 他就是个鬼故事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like you said, he's a ghost story.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.66,0:53:23.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就看看这个鬼到底想要什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, let's find out what the ghost wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.58,0:53:26.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼克·弗瑞被残忍地谋杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick Fury was murdered in cold blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:26.38,0:53:27.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但凡是个正常人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To any reasonable person,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.81,0:53:30.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都会说他是烈士 而非叛徒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that would make him a martyr, not a traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.61,0:53:32.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道他怎么是叛徒了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what makes him a traitor?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.19,0:53:34.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他让雇佣兵劫持自己的船\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hiring a mercenary to hijack his own ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.87,0:53:37.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼克·弗瑞利用与你的交情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nick Fury used your friendship
Dialogue: 0,0:53:37.12,0:53:40.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,强迫理事会延迟洞察计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to coerce this council into delaying Project Insight.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:40.34,0:53:43.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他知道这个计划会暴露他的非法行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A project he knew would expose his own illegal operations.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.05,0:53:44.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说好听点 他骗了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At best, he lied to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.59,0:53:48.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 说句不好听的 - 你们是让我引咎辞职吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- At worst... - Are you calling for my resignation?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.60,0:53:49.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在就可以写辞呈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got a pen and paper right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.92,0:53:52.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个我们可以迟点讨论\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That discussion can be tabled for a later time.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.05,0:53:55.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们还真想让我辞职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you do want to have a discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.58,0:53:57.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经谈过了 部长先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've already had it, Mr. Secretary.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.62,0:54:03.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,理事会决定立即重启洞察计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This council moves to immediately reactivate Project Insight.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.26,0:54:07.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要是想耍嘴皮子 赶紧趁现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you want to say something snappy, now would be a good time.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.83,0:54:17.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逃亡第一准则 只能走不能跑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First rule of going on the run is, don't run, walk.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.87,0:54:20.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果穿着这双鞋跑 早就掉下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I run in these shoes, they're gonna fall off.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.11,0:54:24.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个U盘拥有六级定位系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The drive has a level six homing program,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:24.87,0:54:27.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦启动 神盾局就能定位我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so as soon as we boot up S.H.I.E.L.D will know exactly where we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.06,0:54:29.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有多长时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How much time do we have?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.04,0:54:32.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九分钟吧 现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About nine minutes from...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.10,0:54:33.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.24,0:54:41.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗瑞的猜测是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fury was right about that ship,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.26,0:54:43.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有人想在那艘船上藏东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}somebody's trying to hide something.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.96,0:54:45.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.39,0:54:45.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个U盘被某种人工智能保护着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This drive is protected by some sort of AI,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.67,0:54:48.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直在重新编程 抵抗我的指令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it keeps rewriting itself to counter my commands.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.25,0:54:49.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能破解吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you override it?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:50.63,0:54:53.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开发这个程序的人比我聪明点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The person who developed this is slightly smarter than me.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.64,0:54:54.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就那么一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slightly.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.26,0:55:07.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要试试追踪程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna try running a tracer.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.63,0:55:09.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是神盾局用来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a program that S.H.I.E.L.D
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.19,0:55:10.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,追踪恶意软件的程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}developed to track hostile malware,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.91,0:55:14.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算我们读不到文件\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so if we can't read the file,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.02,0:55:16.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许可以查到它的来源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe we can find out where it came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.17,0:55:17.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么可以帮到你们的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I help you guys with anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.97,0:55:18.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.91,0:55:21.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟未婚夫正在选度蜜月的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My fiancé was just helping me with some honeymoon destinations.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.68,0:55:23.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 我们要结婚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right! We're getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.76,0:55:24.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,恭喜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.64,0:55:26.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们准备去哪呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where do you guys thinking about going?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.34,0:55:27.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(新泽西州)
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.63,0:55:28.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新泽西州\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New Jersey.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.11,0:55:36.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也有这款眼镜\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have the exact same glasses.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.95,0:55:38.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们还真像双胞胎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow, you two are practically twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.80,0:55:41.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也希望有你的身材\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I wish. Specimen.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.31,0:55:43.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什么需要的话可以找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you guys need anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.79,0:55:45.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我叫本·亚伦 - 谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm Ben Aaron. - Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.84,0:55:48.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九分钟要到了 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said nine minutes, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.83,0:55:50.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh, relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:51.54,0:55:52.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.62,0:55:55.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(新泽西州 维顿)
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.74,0:55:57.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你熟悉这地方吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.78,0:56:00.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,曾经很熟 走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I used to. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.67,0:56:02.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,标准战术小队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Standard tac-team.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.94,0:56:06.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两前两后 侧翼还有两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two behind, two across, two coming straight at us.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.14,0:56:07.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果被发现了 我跟他们打\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they make us, I'll engage,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.60,0:56:09.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你搭南边的扶梯去地铁站\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you hit the south escalator to the metro.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.21,0:56:11.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴 搂着我 笑两声\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up and put your arm around me, laugh at something I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.30,0:56:12.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.89,0:56:22.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未发现信号源\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Negative at the source.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:22.14,0:56:23.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搜索每一层楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a floor rundown.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.55,0:56:24.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三楼未发现目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Negative on three.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.28,0:56:26.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二楼未发现目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Negative on two.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.34,0:56:28.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从最高层往下搜 与我汇合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scan the upper levels, work down to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:36.70,0:56:37.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 吻我 - 什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kiss me. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.92,0:56:40.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公共场合秀恩爱 让人很不自在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Public displays of affection make people very uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.15,0:56:40.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.80,0:56:52.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不自在吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still uncomfortable?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.36,0:56:55.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不能这么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not exactly the word I would use.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.30,0:56:56.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(欢迎来到新泽西 花园之州)
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.14,0:57:02.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(欢迎来到新泽西 花园之州)
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.01,0:57:06.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国队长从哪学的偷车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did Captain America learn how to steal a car?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.21,0:57:08.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纳粹德国\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nazi Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.02,0:57:11.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有这车是借来的 脚别放在仪表盘上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we're borrowing. Take your feet off the dash.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.04,0:57:16.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧 我有个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, I have a question for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:16.93,0:57:18.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可以不回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of which you do not have to answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.10,0:57:20.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过我觉得如果你不回答\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like if you don't answer it though,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.21,0:57:21.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也算是回答了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you're kind of answering it, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.40,0:57:22.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.02,0:57:24.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚刚是你自1945年来 第一次接吻吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was that your first kiss since 1945?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.96,0:57:25.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有那么糟吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That bad, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.87,0:57:26.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可没那么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.61,0:57:28.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听起来就是那个意思\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, it kind of sounds like that's what you're saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.40,0:57:31.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是 我只是好奇你练习过几次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I didn't. I just wondered how much practice you had.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.39,0:57:33.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我不需要练习 - 每个人都需要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I don't need practice. - Everybody needs practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.50,0:57:36.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是我自1945年来的第一次接吻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was not my first kiss since 1945.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.23,0:57:38.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是95岁了 可我不是死人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm ninety-five, I'm not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.28,0:57:39.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没遇到过特别的人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nobody special, though?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.18,0:57:42.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管你信不信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe it or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.68,0:57:45.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要找个和我有类似人生经历的人不太容易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's kind of hard to find someone with shared life experience.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.63,0:57:47.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,管他的 你随便编个故事就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that's alright, you just make something up.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.77,0:57:48.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像你一样吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.29,0:57:51.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道 说实话也要看情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. The truth is a matter of circumstances,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:51.16,0:57:54.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能对谁都掏心窝\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's not all things to all people all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.95,0:57:56.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And neither am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.69,0:57:58.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样活着很累\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a tough way to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.10,0:58:00.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但能保命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a good way not to die, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.06,0:58:03.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不了解一个人的本质\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, it's kind of hard to trust someone
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.51,0:58:05.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么信任他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you don't know who that someone really is.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.34,0:58:07.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.61,0:58:11.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你希望我是什么样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who do you want me to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.72,0:58:13.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朋友怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about a friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.06,0:58:18.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得你当初\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, there's a chance you might be
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.13,0:58:20.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是入错行了 罗杰斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}in the wrong business, Rogers.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.06,0:58:37.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这儿吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.56,0:58:41.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,文件就是从这儿发出的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The file came from these coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.55,0:58:44.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(里海营)
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.60,0:58:43.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也来自这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So did I.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.09,0:58:54.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就是在这个营地受训的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This camp is where I was trained.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.86,0:58:58.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变化很大吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Changed much?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.54,0:59:01.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.68,0:59:03.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟上 姑娘们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick up the pace, ladies!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.25,0:59:08.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑 加速\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's go! Let's go! Double time!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.01,0:59:11.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快跑 罗杰斯 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on Rogers, move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.10,0:59:16.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点 归队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on! Fall in!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.00,0:59:20.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗杰斯 我说归队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rogers! I said fall in!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.55,0:59:23.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里没戏\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is a dead end.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.76,0:59:26.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没热成像 没信号 连无线电波都没有\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zero heat signature, zero waves, not even radio.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.14,0:59:29.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,编写文件的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoever wrote the file
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.05,0:59:31.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该用了路由器来摆脱追踪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}must have used a router to throw people off.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:33.04,0:59:34.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.18,0:59:36.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按照军规 营房五百码范围内\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Army regulations forbid storing ammunition
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.15,0:59:38.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,禁止存放弹药\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}within five hundred yards from the barracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.83,0:59:40.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这栋建筑不该建在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This building is in the wrong place.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.09,0:59:57.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是神盾局的地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is S.H.I.E.L.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.09,1:00:00.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能就是在这成立的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe where it started.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.87,1:00:07.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(国土战略防御攻击与后勤保障局)
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.18,1:00:20.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是斯塔克的爸爸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's Stark's father.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.33,1:00:22.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,霍华德\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Howard.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.16,1:00:25.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这姑娘是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's the girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.76,1:00:47.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这么隐秘的地方工作\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you already working in a secret office
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.52,1:00:59.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么还要藏着电梯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}why do you need to hide the elevator?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.71,1:01:54.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,数据源不可能在这里 这些都是老古董了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This can't be the data-point, this technology is ancient.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.07,1:02:21.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是否启动系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Initiate system?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.24,1:02:26.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,输入 是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Y-E-S, spells yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.45,1:02:32.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们玩个游戏吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Shall we play a game?"
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.99,1:02:35.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 这是一部电影的台词 - 我看过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's from a movie that... - Yeah, I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.00,1:02:44.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史蒂文·罗杰斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rogers, Steven.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.96,1:02:47.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1918年出生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Born, 1918.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.64,1:02:52.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娜塔莉·阿莲诺娃·罗曼诺夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Romanoff, Natalia Alianovna.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.71,1:02:54.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1984年出生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Born, 1984.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.73,1:02:56.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是录像吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's some kind of a recording.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.31,1:02:59.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才不是录像 女士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am not a recording, Fraulein.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.25,1:03:01.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然我已经不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I may not be the man I was
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.39,1:03:04.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1945年队长抓到我时的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when the Captain took me prisoner in 1945,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.87,1:03:06.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.04,1:03:10.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认识这玩意吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know this thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:13.21,1:03:16.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,阿尔宁·佐拉是红骷髅手下的德国科学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arnim Zola was a German scientist who worked for the Red Skull.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.59,1:03:17.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经死了很多年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been dead for years.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:17.69,1:03:20.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,纠正第一点 我是瑞士人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}First correction, I am Swiss.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.42,1:03:22.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二点 看看周围\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Second, look around you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.94,1:03:26.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我活得生龙活虎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have never been more alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.17,1:03:30.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,1972年 我被确诊患有绝症\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In 1972 I received a terminal diagnosis.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.71,1:03:35.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,科学拯救不了我的身体 但我的思想\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Science could not save my body, my mind, however,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.66,1:03:37.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,值得留存\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that was worth saving
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.96,1:03:41.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,于是存在了这20万单元的数据库中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on two hundred thousand feet of data banks.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.03,1:03:45.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们就在我的大脑里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are standing in my brain.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.72,1:03:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么会在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How did you get here?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.90,1:03:48.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应邀而来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Invited.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.56,1:03:51.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二战之后的回形针行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was Operation Paperclip after World War II.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.28,1:03:54.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神盾局招募了具有战略价值的德国科学家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}S.H.I.E.L.D recruited German scientists with strategic values.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.92,1:03:57.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们觉得我能帮他们实现目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They thought I could help their cause.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.07,1:03:59.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也实现了自己的目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I also helped my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.06,1:04:00.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九头蛇跟红骷髅一起消亡了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hydra died with the Red Skull.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.96,1:04:04.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,砍掉一颗头 会再长出两个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut off one head, two more shall take its place.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.18,1:04:06.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,证明给我看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prove it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.20,1:04:10.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,存档读取中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Accessing archive.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.67,1:04:13.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九头蛇创立时的信条\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hydra was founded on the belief
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.21,1:04:17.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是人类不能掌控自身的自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that humanity could not be trusted with its own freedom.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.45,1:04:19.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我们没意识到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we did not realize,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.46,1:04:23.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,若去夺走自由 他们会反抗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was that if you try to take that freedom, they resist.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.67,1:04:20.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:20.92,1:04:21.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.98,1:04:26.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战争教会了我们很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The war taught us much.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.16,1:04:30.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,得让人类自愿放弃自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Humanity needed to surrender its freedom willingly.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.67,1:04:33.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,战争结束后 神盾局成立\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After the war, S.H.I.E.L.D was founded
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.69,1:04:35.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还招募了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I was recruited.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.22,1:04:36.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.96,1:04:38.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,新的九头蛇诞生了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The new Hydra grew.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.31,1:04:37.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.24,1:04:43.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像神盾局里一条美丽的寄生虫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A beautiful parasite inside S.H.I.E.L.D.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.10,1:04:44.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,七十年来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For seventy years
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.82,1:04:48.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九头蛇一直在幕后煽动危机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hydra has been secretly feeding crisis,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.90,1:04:50.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,引发战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}reaping war.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.86,1:04:53.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当历史的发展与预期不符\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And when history did not cooperate,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.08,1:04:56.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就改变历史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}history was changed.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.24,1:04:54.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.02,1:04:58.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可能 神盾局不会放任你不管\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's impossible, S.H.I.E.L.D would have stopped you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.33,1:05:01.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意外总是不可避免的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Accidents will happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.37,1:04:59.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:01.67,1:05:02.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(死亡)
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.72,1:05:05.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九头蛇制造了一个如此混乱的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hydra created a world so chaotic
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.86,1:05:08.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使得人类终于愿意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that humanity is finally ready
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.08,1:05:12.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,牺牲自由以换取安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to sacrifice its freedom to gain its security.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.80,1:05:16.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦净化程序完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once the Purification Process is complete,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.01,1:05:14.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.68,1:05:15.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.64,1:05:20.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九头蛇的新世界秩序就会形成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hydra's new world order will arise.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.92,1:05:22.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们赢了 队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We won, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.81,1:05:26.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的死亡与你的人生一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your death amounts to the same as your life.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.40,1:05:25.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:25.40,1:05:26.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.01,1:05:28.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毫无意义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A zero sum.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.29,1:05:33.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才我说到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As I was saying...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.36,1:05:35.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这U盘里是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's on this drive?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.59,1:05:37.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洞察计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Project Insight
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.32,1:05:41.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要洞察力 所以我编写了一个算法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}requires insight. So I wrote an algorithm.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.95,1:05:43.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么算法 有什么用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of algorithm? What does it do?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.53,1:05:46.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你问题的答案十分有趣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The answer to your question is fascinating.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.61,1:05:51.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惜 你们要死了 听不到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, you shall be too dead to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.63,1:05:58.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史蒂夫 发现导弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steve, I got a bogey.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.25,1:06:01.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,距离不远 最多只剩30秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Short-range ballistic. Thirty seconds, tops.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.01,1:06:00.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.39,1:06:02.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁发射的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who fired it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.71,1:06:03.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神盾局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}S.H.I.E.L.D.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.32,1:06:07.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一直在拖延时间 队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am afraid I have been stalling, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.31,1:06:10.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,认命吧 这样也是对你好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Admit it, it's better this way.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.06,1:06:15.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们都一样 没时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're both of us out of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:38.51,1:07:40.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他叫来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call in the asset.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.28,1:07:58.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要走了 皮尔斯先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm going to go, Mr. Pierce.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.46,1:08:00.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,走之前还需要我做什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need anything before I leave?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.79,1:08:04.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不了 没事 勒娜特 你回家吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. It's fine, Renata, you can go home.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.81,1:08:06.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, night-night.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.66,1:08:07.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晚安\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.43,1:08:14.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要喝牛奶吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Want some milk?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.69,1:08:26.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间安排有变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The timetable has moved.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.56,1:08:30.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间紧迫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our window is limited.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:34.30,1:08:36.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个六级目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two targets, Level six.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.82,1:08:39.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们已经害我失去了佐拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They already cost me Zola.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.23,1:08:42.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十小时之内都要杀死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want confirmed death in ten hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.43,1:08:46.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 皮尔斯先生 我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Mr. Pierce, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.96,1:08:49.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,忘记拿手机了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I forgot my phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.72,1:08:58.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,勒娜特 你真该敲门的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Renata. I wish you would have knocked.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.41,1:09:23.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.49,1:09:26.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真抱歉 我们需要避避风头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry about this. We need a place to lay low.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.24,1:09:29.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们认识的人都想杀了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everyone we know is trying to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.87,1:09:33.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not everyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.46,1:09:51.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.42,1:09:52.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.07,1:10:02.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.75,1:10:06.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我当初加入神盾局的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I first joined S.H.I.E.L.D,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:06.86,1:10:08.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还以为是走上了正路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought it was going straight.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.07,1:10:15.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结果也就是从克格勃换到了九头蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I guess I just traded in the KGB for Hydra.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.64,1:10:24.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我本以为知道我在为谁撒谎 但...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought I knew whose lies I was telling, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.58,1:10:29.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在我也分不清了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I can't tell the difference anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.41,1:10:33.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可能是入错行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a chance you might be in the wrong business.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.58,1:10:39.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我欠你个人情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I owe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.34,1:10:42.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.70,1:10:44.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,换成是我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it was the other way around,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.26,1:10:47.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的命攥在我手里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it was down to me to save your life,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.85,1:10:49.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说实话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you be honest with me,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.73,1:10:53.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会把性命托付给我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}would you trust me to do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:55.75,1:10:57.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would now.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:59.65,1:11:01.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我从不说谎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm always honest.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.74,1:11:04.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你刚发现自己白牺牲了一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, you seem pretty chipper for someone
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.54,1:11:06.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还能这么乐观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}who just found out they died for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.73,1:11:11.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道对手是谁就很开心了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I guess I just like to know who I'm fighting.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.42,1:11:12.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我做了早饭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.94,1:11:16.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们吃人间烟火吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you guys eat that sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.73,1:11:18.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, the question is:
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.81,1:11:21.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神盾局里有谁有能力在境内发射导弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who in S.H.I.E.L.D could launch a domestic missile strike?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.05,1:11:24.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皮尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pierce.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.41,1:11:25.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他碰巧正坐在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who happens to be sitting
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.14,1:11:27.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全世界最安全的大楼顶层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on top of the most secure building in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.20,1:11:28.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他不是孤军奋战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he's not working alone,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.33,1:11:31.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐拉的算法在雷姆利亚星号上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zola's algorithm was on the Lemurian Star.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.96,1:11:33.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,贾斯珀·西特韦尔也在上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So was Jasper Sitwell.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.08,1:11:38.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以关键问题是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, the real question is:
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.07,1:11:40.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个华盛顿的头号通缉犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do the two most wanted people in Washington
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.17,1:11:42.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么在光天化日下绑架神盾局官员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}kidnap a S.H.I.E.L.D officer in broad daylight?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.35,1:11:45.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,答案是 不需要绑架\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The answer is: you don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.20,1:11:46.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.99,1:11:48.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是简历吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Call it a resume.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.66,1:11:52.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是巴马拉吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this Bakhmala?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.23,1:11:55.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你参加了哈立德·汗迪尔任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Khalid Khandil mission, that was you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.59,1:11:58.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你可没说他是空降救援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't say he was a para-rescue.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.65,1:12:00.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是莱利吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this Riley?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.15,1:12:01.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.98,1:12:04.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我听说因为有火箭弹 直升机飞不进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard they couldn't bring in the choppers because of the RPGs.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.93,1:12:06.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们用的是什么 隐形降落伞吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What did you use, a stealth chute?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.19,1:12:08.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 是这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. These.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.02,1:12:15.53,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不是说你是飞行员吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you said you're a pilot.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.53,1:12:17.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可没那么说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never said a pilot.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.90,1:12:22.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能请你帮忙 山姆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't ask you to do this, Sam.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.28,1:12:24.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你退役是有原因的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got out for a good reason.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.58,1:12:26.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,伙计 美国队长需要我帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, Captain America needs my help.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.55,1:12:28.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这理由还不够吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no better reason to get back in.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.00,1:12:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这东西哪能拿到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where can we get our hands on one of these things?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.92,1:12:35.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后一套在米德堡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The last one is at Fort Meade,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.01,1:12:39.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三道有守卫的门和一堵12英寸厚的钢墙后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}behind three guarded gates and a twelve-inch steel wall.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.56,1:12:42.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该没什么问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shouldn't be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.92,1:12:44.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(猎鹰 机密)
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.22,1:12:46.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今晚得飞回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I gotta fly home tonight,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.28,1:12:49.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,选区出了点问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}cause I got some constituency problem,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.13,1:12:51.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得处理一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I gotta press the flesh.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.30,1:12:53.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是哪位选民有问题吗 参议员先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any constituent in particular, Mr. Senator?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.96,1:12:55.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不算是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Uh...no, not really.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.52,1:12:59.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,23岁 有点火辣 相当辣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Twenty-three, kind of hot. Real hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.90,1:13:01.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像是想当个记者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, wants to be a reporter, I think.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.93,1:13:03.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不记得了 谁有心思听她说话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know, who listens at that point?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.89,1:13:05.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像不是什么问题啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Doesn't sound much of a problem to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.68,1:13:08.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗 她要把我的背累坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? Cause she's killing my back.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.53,1:13:10.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这地方不适合谈这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, this isn't the place to talk about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.63,1:13:11.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别针不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's a nice pin.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.92,1:13:13.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多谢夸奖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.48,1:13:15.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:16.53,1:13:17.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九头蛇万岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hail, Hydra.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.32,1:13:20.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看到了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See that, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.98,1:13:22.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 看到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just saw that, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:23.34,1:13:25.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我该去检查检查吗 - 检查一下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Should I get it checked? - I think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.93,1:13:32.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(亚历山大·皮尔斯来电)
Dialogue: 0,1:13:33.68,1:13:35.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们先去把车开过来等我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need a minute. Bring the car around.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.47,1:13:41.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你好 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.40,1:13:43.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,西特韦尔特工 午餐吃得好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agent Sitwell, how was lunch?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.26,1:13:45.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听说这里的蟹饼相当不错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hear the crab cakes here are delicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.20,1:13:46.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:46.91,1:13:49.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,十点钟方向戴着墨镜的帅哥\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The good looking guy in the sunglasses, your ten o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:52.01,1:13:53.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另一个十点钟方向\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your other ten o'clock.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.18,1:13:56.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看到了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.87,1:13:59.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你想干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.43,1:14:02.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你右转过拐角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna go around the corner, to your right.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.76,1:14:05.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第二个车位上有辆灰色车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a grey car, two spaces down.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.28,1:14:06.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们去兜个风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and I are gonna take a ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.53,1:14:08.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我为什么要听你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why would I do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.31,1:14:12.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为那条领带看起来挺贵的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because that tie looks really expensive,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:12.13,1:14:14.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不想给弄脏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I'd hate to mess it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.86,1:14:25.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我佐拉算法的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me about Zola's algorithm.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.33,1:14:26.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从没听说过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Never heard of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.84,1:14:28.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在雷姆利亚星号上干了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What were you doing on the Lemurian Star?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.24,1:14:30.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,晕船了 一直在吐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was throwing up, I get seasick.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.57,1:14:37.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,搞这出是想暗示\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this little display meant to insinuate
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.19,1:14:38.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你打算把我丢下屋顶吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you can throw me off the roof?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.51,1:14:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这可不是你的作风 罗杰斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cause it's really not your style, Rogers.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.76,1:14:45.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说对了 的确不是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're right. It's not.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.31,1:14:47.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是她的作风\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's hers.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.50,1:14:52.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下 会计部的那姑娘怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, wait. What about that girl from accounting,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.23,1:14:53.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫劳拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Laura... Laura...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.54,1:14:55.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是莉莉安 有唇环的那个吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lillian. Lip piercing, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.69,1:14:56.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 她挺可爱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, she's cute.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.76,1:14:58.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还没法接受唇环\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm not ready for that.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.23,1:15:12.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐拉算法是个程序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zola's algorithm is a program...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.92,1:15:16.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为洞察计划选择目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for choosing Insight's targets!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.03,1:15:17.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么目标\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What targets?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.21,1:15:17.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.29,1:15:20.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开罗的电视主持人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A TV anchor in Cairo,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.41,1:15:21.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,国防部副部长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the Undersecretary of Defense,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.72,1:15:23.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,艾奥瓦城的高中毕业致辞学生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a high school valedictorian in Iowa city.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.45,1:15:25.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布鲁斯·班纳 斯蒂芬·斯特兰奇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bruce Banner, Stephen Strange,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.58,1:15:27.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有威胁到九头蛇的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}anyone who's a threat to Hydra!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.48,1:15:30.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不论现在还是未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, or in the future.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.71,1:15:32.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,未来 它怎么预测未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Future? How could it know?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.40,1:15:37.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,当然可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How could it not?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.13,1:15:42.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,21世纪就是一本电子书\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The 21st century is a digital book.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.63,1:15:45.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐拉教会了九头蛇读懂它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zola taught Hydra how to read it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.60,1:15:51.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的银行记录 病史\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your bank records, medical histories,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.05,1:15:52.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,投票倾向 电子邮件 打的电话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}voting patterns, e-mails, phone calls,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.90,1:15:54.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有高考成绩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your damn SAT scores.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.56,1:15:59.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐拉算法通过分析人们的过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zola's algorithm evaluates peoples' past
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.92,1:16:01.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,预测他们的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to predict their future.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.85,1:16:02.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what then?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.10,1:16:07.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老天 皮尔斯会杀了我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God. Pierce is gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.95,1:16:09.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What then?!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.22,1:16:15.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后洞察计划的天空航母会除掉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then the Insight Helicarriers scratch people off the list.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.38,1:16:18.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一次解决几百万人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A few millions at a time.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.85,1:16:27.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九头蛇可不喜欢泄密者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hydra doesn't like leaks.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.94,1:16:29.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你就把嘴塞上吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why don't you try sticking a cork in it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.90,1:16:31.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洞察计划16小时候后启动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Insight's launching in sixteen hours,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.43,1:16:32.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们时间有点紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're cutting it a little bit close here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.70,1:16:34.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道 我们用他绕过DNA扫描\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know. We'll use him to bypass the DNA scans
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.63,1:16:36.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直接上天空航母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and access the Helicarriers directly.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.28,1:16:38.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 你们疯了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?! Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.33,1:16:40.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这主意糟透了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That is a terrible, terrible idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.05,1:17:24.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:36.36,1:17:37.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抓紧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.95,1:19:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她交给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have her.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.83,1:19:21.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们去找他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.52,1:20:27.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快走 这里交给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go, I got this!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.66,1:21:03.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,着陆地点 弗吉尼亚大道2300街区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I make an LZ, twenty-three hundred block at Virginia Avenue.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.51,1:21:04.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两分钟后会合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rendezvous two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.81,1:21:10.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有平民受到威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Civilians threatened.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.06,1:21:12.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重复 有平民受到威胁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Repeat, civilians threatened.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.15,1:21:18.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,着陆地点 弗吉尼亚大道2300街区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I make an LZ, twenty-three hundred block at Virginia Avenue.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.14,1:21:20.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.96,1:21:20.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两分钟后会合\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rendezvous two minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.71,1:21:48.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让开 快让开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out of the way! Stay out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:35.76,1:23:36.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bucky?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:37.34,1:23:38.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁他妈是巴基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who the hell is Bucky?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.31,1:24:09.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放下盾牌 队长 跪在地上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop the shield, Captain! On your knees!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.32,1:24:12.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跪在地上 快跪下 跪下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get on your knees! Now! Get down! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:12.04,1:24:14.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跪在地上 跪下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get on your knees! Down!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:15.54,1:24:16.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不许动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.97,1:24:27.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把枪放下 别在这儿这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put the gun down. Not here. Not here!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.56,1:24:43.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was him.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.13,1:24:49.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他就这么看着我 却不认识我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He looked right at me and he didn't even know me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.94,1:24:51.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这怎么可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's that even possible?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.00,1:24:52.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都过去七十年了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was like seventy years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.94,1:24:53.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是佐拉干的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zola.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.46,1:24:56.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴基所在的部队曾在1943年被俘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bucky's whole unit was captured in '43,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.31,1:24:58.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,佐拉拿他们做过人体实验\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zola experimented on 'em.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.53,1:25:00.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能就是因为这个 他摔下火车后活了下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever he did, it helped Bucky survive the fall.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.64,1:25:03.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们一定找到了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They must have found him.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.87,1:25:05.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是你的错 史蒂夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}None of that's your fault, Steve.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.35,1:25:11.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一无所有的时候 却还有巴基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even when I had nothing, I had Bucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.50,1:25:16.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快找个医生过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to get a doctor here.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.21,1:25:17.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不压紧伤口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't put pressure on that wound
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.33,1:25:19.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会失血过多死在车上的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}she's gonna bleed out here in the truck.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.26,1:25:29.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这玩意压得我头疼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That thing was squeezing my brain.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.82,1:25:33.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这人是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's this guy?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.50,1:25:46.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三个坑 开挖吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Three holes. Start digging.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.67,1:26:15.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她中枪了 失血一品脱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}GSW. She's lost at least a pint.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.99,1:26:16.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许有两品脱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe two.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.81,1:26:17.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交给我吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me take her!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:18.00,1:26:19.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她会想先见见他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll wants to see him first.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.10,1:26:31.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About damn time.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:33.32,1:26:36.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脊柱损伤 胸骨断裂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lacerated spinal column, cracked sternum,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.88,1:26:40.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,锁骨粉碎 肝穿孔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}shattered collarbone, perforated liver,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.67,1:26:42.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再加上要命的头疼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one hell of a headache.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.52,1:26:44.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别忘了肺萎陷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't forget your collapsed lung.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.05,1:26:47.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对 这可不能忘了 除此之外都挺好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, let's not forget that. Otherwise, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.77,1:26:49.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可他们给你做了开膛手术 你心跳都停了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They cut you open, your heart stopped.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:49.95,1:26:54.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,河豚毒素B 能把脉搏降到一分钟一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tetrodotoxin B. Slows the pulse to one beat a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:54.33,1:26:56.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,班纳发明用来控制压力的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Banner developed it for stress.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.30,1:26:59.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对他没多大作用 但我们发现了它的新用途\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't work so great for him, but we found a use for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:59.11,1:27:01.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要这么保密 为什么不告诉我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why all the secrecy? Why not just tell us?
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.05,1:27:03.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为了让意图谋害局长的人以为暗杀成功了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any attempt on the director's life had to look successful.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:04.01,1:27:06.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死人不能再被刺杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't kill you if you're already dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.78,1:27:11.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,另外 我也不知道还能相信谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, I wasn't sure who to trust.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.08,1:27:16.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(银行)
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.11,1:27:27.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴恩斯中士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sergeant Barnes...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.59,1:27:30.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴基 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bucky, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.15,1:27:37.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,改造程序已经开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The procedure has already started.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:41.04,1:27:45.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你将会成为九头蛇的新武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are to be the new face of Hydra.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.42,1:27:46.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他冷冻起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put him on ice.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.71,1:28:02.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官 他状态不稳定 情绪失常\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, he's...he's unstable. Erratic.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.31,1:28:17.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,任务汇报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mission report.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.40,1:28:21.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开始任务汇报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mission report, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.71,1:28:36.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桥上的那个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The man on the bridge...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.15,1:28:40.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who was he?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.92,1:28:44.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这周早些时候执行另一个任务时见过他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You met him earlier this week on another assignment.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.44,1:28:48.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认识他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I knew him.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.19,1:28:59.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做的事造福了全人类\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your work has been a gift to mankind.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.19,1:29:03.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你塑造了这个世纪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shaped this century,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.28,1:29:06.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我需要你再做一次\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I need you to do it one more time.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.81,1:29:11.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人类社会正处在秩序与混乱的临界点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Society is at a tipping point between order and chaos.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.72,1:29:13.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天早上我们要帮他们抉择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tomorrow morning we're gonna give it a push.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.65,1:29:18.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果你不完成你的任务 我就没法着手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if you don't do your part, I can't do mine,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.50,1:29:23.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九头蛇就没法还世界它应得的自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and Hydra can't give the world the freedom it deserves.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.35,1:29:27.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我认识他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I knew him.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.51,1:29:35.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给他准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prep him.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.34,1:29:38.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他脱离低温冷冻太久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's been out of cryo-freeze too long.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.10,1:29:41.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就给他洗脑 重新来过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then wipe him and start over.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.87,1:30:26.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个人拒绝了诺贝尔和平奖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This man declined the Nobel Peace Prize.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.39,1:30:26.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.01,1:30:30.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说 和平不是一项成就\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He said, "Peace wasn't an achievement,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:30.91,1:30:32.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而是一种责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it was a responsibility."
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.98,1:30:37.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这种事害我有信任危机\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, it's stuff like this that gives me trust issues.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.04,1:30:39.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得阻止航母发射\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to stop the launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.24,1:30:43.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得理事会不会再接我的电话了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think the Council's accepting my calls anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.42,1:30:46.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:46.42,1:30:49.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天空航母飞到三千英尺高后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Once the Helicarriers reach three thousand feet,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:49.38,1:30:51.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会利用洞察卫星三角定位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they'll triangulate with Insight Satellites
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.30,1:30:51.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.67,1:30:53.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,变成杀伤性武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}becoming fully weaponized.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.55,1:30:55.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须渗入航母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to breach those carriers
Dialogue: 0,1:30:55.22,1:30:58.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,将上面的定位模块换成我们自己的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and replace their targeting blades with our own.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.18,1:30:59.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只换一两个没用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One or two won't cut it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:59.18,1:31:01.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必须把三艘航母都连接到一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to link all three carriers for this to work,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.98,1:31:05.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为即使只剩一艘航母正常运转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because if even one of those ships remains operational
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.84,1:31:07.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是会死很多人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a whole lot of people are gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.78,1:31:10.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们必须假设航母上的都是九头蛇的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to assume everyone aboard those carriers is Hydra.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.04,1:31:12.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们得闯过他们那一关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We need to get pass them,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.04,1:31:13.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把模块插进服务器 也许\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}insert the server blades, and maybe,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:13.71,1:31:16.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是也许 我们可以挽救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just maybe, we can salvage what's left...
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.25,1:31:17.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们什么都不挽救\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not salvaging anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.74,1:31:19.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们不止要摧毁航母 尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not just taking down the carriers, Nick,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.21,1:31:20.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们还要推翻神盾局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're taking down S.H.I.E.L.D.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:20.29,1:31:21.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神盾局跟此事无关\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}S.H.I.E.L.D had nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.73,1:31:24.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你把任务交给我 我就要这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gave me this mission, this is how it ends.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.11,1:31:25.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神盾局有问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}S.H.I.E.L.D's been compromised,
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.12,1:31:26.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是你的原话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you've said so yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.39,1:31:28.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九头蛇在就你眼皮底下发展 却没人发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hydra was right under your nose and nobody noticed.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.40,1:31:30.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我们为什么在这个山洞里见面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why do you think we're meeting in this cave?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:30.52,1:31:31.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我发现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I noticed.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.92,1:31:33.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你发现之前有多少人付出了生命的代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how many paid the price before you did?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.78,1:31:38.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的不知道巴恩斯的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, I didn't know about Barnes.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.68,1:31:40.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算你知道 你会告诉我吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even if you have, would you have told me?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.88,1:31:42.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是继续你所谓的各司其职\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or would you have compartmentalized that too?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.68,1:31:47.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神盾局 九头蛇 一个都不能留\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}S.H.I.E.L.D, Hydra, it all goes.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.43,1:31:49.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.56,1:31:56.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别看我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.63,1:31:58.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他做什么我就做什么 就是比他慢点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do what he does, just slower.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:02.46,1:32:03.23,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.36,1:32:12.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来现在要由你来下令了 队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like you're giving the orders now, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.29,1:32:25.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们完事后找过你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We looked for you after.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:27.04,1:32:29.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我父母想开车送你从墓地回家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My folks wanted to give you a ride from the cemetery.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:29.15,1:32:30.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道 很抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.07,1:32:32.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我只是 想一个人待一会儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just kind of wanted to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:33.95,1:32:35.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葬礼怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How was it?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:35.85,1:32:38.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就那样吧 我妈葬在了我爸旁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was okay. She's next to Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:41.20,1:32:42.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想问你...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was gonna ask...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.84,1:32:45.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你想问什么 巴基 只是我...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what you're gonna say, Buck, I just...
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.53,1:32:48.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们可以像小时候那样 把沙发垫铺在地板上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can put the couch cushion on the floor like when we were kids.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:49.10,1:32:51.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那多好啊 你只要帮我擦擦鞋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It'll be fun. All you gotta do is shine my shoes,
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.32,1:32:53.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者倒个垃圾什么的就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}maybe take out the trash.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:58.87,1:32:59.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:03.37,1:33:06.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢 巴基 不过我自己能行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, Buck, but I can get by on my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:07.60,1:33:11.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,问题是 你不必这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The thing is, you don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.66,1:33:16.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会陪你走到最后的 哥们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm with you till the end of the line, pal.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.45,1:33:20.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他一定会在那儿的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's gonna be there, you know?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:21.40,1:33:22.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:23.00,1:33:26.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听着 不管他以前怎么样 现在的他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, whoever he used to be, the guy he is now,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:26.92,1:33:29.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不能去拯救了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think he's the kind you save.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:29.26,1:33:30.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你需要阻止他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the kind you stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.40,1:33:35.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道我下不下得去手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if I could do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.41,1:33:37.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他也许会逼得你没得选\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he might not give you a choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:37.45,1:33:38.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他不记得你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He doesn't know you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:39.76,1:33:40.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他会记起来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:43.56,1:33:45.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,时间到了 准备出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gear up, it's time.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.89,1:33:48.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就穿这身去吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gonna wear that?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.90,1:33:50.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 要去打仗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. If you're gonna fight a war,
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.49,1:33:52.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就得穿上军装\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you gotta wear a uniform.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.17,1:34:05.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完了 饭碗丢定了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, man. I am so fired!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:29.46,1:34:31.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进入发射的最后阶段\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are in final launch sequence.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.06,1:34:33.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(洞察发射)
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.12,1:34:35.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,制导系统就绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are go on guidance.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.98,1:34:39.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有人员请前往发射台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All personnel, to launch station.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.90,1:34:41.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞行旅途如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how was your flight?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:41.36,1:34:44.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很不错 不过从机场来这的路上不怎么样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lovely. The ride from the airport less so.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:45.10,1:34:47.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很遗憾神盾局没法控制一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sadly, S.H.I.E.L.D can't control everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:47.72,1:34:49.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包括美国队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Including Captain America.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.05,1:34:55.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大楼的身份认证靠生物识别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This facility is biometrically controlled,
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.79,1:34:58.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这胸章能让你们在这里畅行无阻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and these will give you unrestricted access.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:02.70,1:35:04.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我把车停在那儿两个月了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been parking there for two months.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.00,1:35:04.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可那是他的车位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's his spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.95,1:35:05.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那他去哪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So where's he been?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:05.82,1:35:07.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大概去阿富汗了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think Afghanistan.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.14,1:35:09.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以 DT6 着陆航线已满\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Negative, DT-6. The pattern is full.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.40,1:35:10.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他该事先说明的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he could have said something.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.34,1:35:13.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天线出问题了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Must be the dish.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.49,1:35:16.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll check it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:24.66,1:35:25.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦让一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.74,1:35:28.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道过程很坎坷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know the road hasn't exactly been smooth,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:28.46,1:35:30.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们中可能有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and some of you would have
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.02,1:35:32.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早就看我不顺眼了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}gladly kicked me out of the car along the way.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.33,1:35:37.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们终于齐聚在这 全世界都将心存感激\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Finally we're here, and the world should be grateful.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.76,1:35:40.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有神盾局特工注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Attention, all S.H.I.E.L.D agents.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:40.50,1:35:42.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是史蒂夫·罗杰斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is Steve Rogers.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:44.31,1:35:46.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这几天你们听到了不少我的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've heard a lot about me over the last few days,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.52,1:35:49.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些人甚至奉命追捕我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}some of you were even ordered to hunt me down.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.52,1:35:52.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我认为应该告诉你们真相\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I think it's time you know the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.47,1:35:58.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神盾局并不是我们想象的样子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}S.H.I.E.L.D is not what we thought it was,
Dialogue: 0,1:35:58.87,1:36:00.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,它已经被九头蛇渗透了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's been taken over by Hydra.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.82,1:36:03.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们的首领是亚历山大·皮尔斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alexander Pierce is their leader.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.32,1:36:09.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突击队和洞察计划的人也是九头蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The S.T.R.I.K.E and Insight crew are Hydra as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.16,1:36:13.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道还有多少 但他们就在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know how many more, but I know they're in the building.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.19,1:36:16.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能就站在你身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They could be standing right next to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.69,1:36:22.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们差点如愿以偿 得到绝对控制权\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They almost have what they want: absolute control.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:23.66,1:36:27.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尼克·弗瑞的被害只是个开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They shot the Nick Fury and it won't end there.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:27.71,1:36:29.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你们今天发射了天空航母\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you launch those helicarriers today,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.74,1:36:31.28,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九头蛇将能够杀死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hydra will be able to kill anyone
Dialogue: 0,1:36:31.29,1:36:32.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所有妨碍他们计划的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that stands in their way,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:35.35,1:36:36.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除非我们阻止他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}unless we stop them.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.79,1:36:42.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道这很难做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know I'm asking a lot,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:44.08,1:36:47.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但自由的代价一向是高昂的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but the price of freedom is high, it always has been,
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.79,1:36:49.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我愿意付出这代价\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and it's a price I'm willing to pay.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:51.87,1:36:54.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪怕只有我一个人 我也会坚持到底\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And if I'm the only one, then so be it.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:56.42,1:36:58.05,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我相信我不是一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I'm willing to bet I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:02.88,1:37:04.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是背的稿子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you write that down first,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:04.99,1:37:06.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是临场发挥的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or was it off the top of your head?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.82,1:37:09.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这婊子养的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You smug son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:13.04,1:37:14.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把他抓起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Arrest him.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:16.38,1:37:17.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来还是我说了算\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I've got the floor.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.08,1:37:26.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,提前发射进程\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Preempt the launch sequence,
Dialogue: 0,1:37:26.50,1:37:28.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上把航母送上天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}send those ships up now.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:32.35,1:37:33.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有意见吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.85,1:37:34.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm...
Dialogue: 0,1:37:38.91,1:37:39.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有意见吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is there a problem?
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.97,1:37:41.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉 长官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.86,1:37:51.57,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会发射航母的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna launch those ships.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:54.93,1:37:56.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长有令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain's orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.35,1:37:57.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离开你的操作台\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move away from your station.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:58.18,1:37:59.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like he said.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:02.17,1:38:03.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长有令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Captain's orders.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:05.21,1:38:07.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你站错边了 特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You picked the wrong side, agent.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:08.49,1:38:09.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那要看你的处境吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Depends on where you're standing.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.72,1:38:40.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(程序重写)
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.43,1:38:55.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关闭舰湾闸门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close the bay door!
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.04,1:38:59.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快关上闸门 快关上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close the bay door now! Close the bay door!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:18.97,1:39:20.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们启动发射了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're initiating launch.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.13,1:39:41.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Cap,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:41.01,1:39:42.88,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么区分坏人和好人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}how do we know the good guys from the bad guys?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.88,1:39:44.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朝你开枪的就是坏人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If they're shooting at you, they're bad.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:18.02,1:40:18.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Cap,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:19.03,1:40:21.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我碰到你说的坏人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found those bad guys you were talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.24,1:40:22.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.29,1:40:25.59,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not dead yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.93,1:40:34.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,容我问一个问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me ask you a question.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:36.77,1:40:39.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果巴基斯坦明天攻进了孟买\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if Pakistan marched into Mumbai tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:41.23,1:40:43.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而你已经知道他们会把你女儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you knew that they were gonna drag your daughters
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.70,1:40:46.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拖到足球场里处决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}into a soccer stadium for execution?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:48.85,1:40:50.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你只需要按一下按钮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you could just stop
Dialogue: 0,1:40:50.73,1:40:54.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能阻止这一切 你会按吗 你们呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it with a flick of a switch. Would you? Wouldn't you all?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:57.21,1:40:59.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不要你的按钮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not if it was your switch.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.25,1:41:24.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:30.99,1:41:32.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抢你风头了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I step on your moment?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:34.10,1:41:36.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卫星到达三千英尺高度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Satellites in range at three thousand feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:37.34,1:41:38.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猎鹰 情况如何\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Falcon, status?
Dialogue: 0,1:41:38.63,1:41:39.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,交战中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Engaging.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.93,1:42:05.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长 我进来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright, Cap, I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:08.04,1:42:08.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:42:39.34,1:42:40.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有八分钟 队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Eight minutes, Cap.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.09,1:42:42.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在努力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Working on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.62,1:42:51.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:51.55,1:42:53.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她在解除安全协议\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's disabling security protocols
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.69,1:42:55.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把所有秘密公布到网上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and dumping all the secrets onto the Internet.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.47,1:42:56.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包括九头蛇的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Including Hydra's.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:56.73,1:42:57.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也有神盾局的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And S.H.I.E.L.D's.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.73,1:42:59.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一旦你这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you do this,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:59.41,1:43:01.55,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的过去就都大白于天下了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}none of your past is gonna remain hidden.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:04.62,1:43:06.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定想让\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you sure you're ready
Dialogue: 0,1:43:06.03,1:43:08.34,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全世界都看到你的真面目吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for the world to see you as you really are?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.75,1:43:10.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:27.48,1:43:28.38,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,A船替换完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alpha locked.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:30.62,1:43:32.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猎鹰 你在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Falcon, where are you now?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:32.10,1:43:33.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我得先兜个圈子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had to take a detour!
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.67,1:44:14.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我进来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm in.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:17.84,1:44:19.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B船替换完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bravo locked.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.60,1:44:23.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解决两个 还剩一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two down, one to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:25.05,1:44:26.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全体神盾局飞行员 紧急起飞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All S.H.I.E.L.D pilots, scramble.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:27.39,1:44:30.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们是罗杰斯队长仅有的空中支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're the only air support Captain Rogers has got.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.15,1:45:12.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(访问受限)
Dialogue: 0,1:45:12.39,1:45:15.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解锁是行政命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disabling the encryption is an executive order,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.24,1:45:17.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,需要两名A级人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it takes two Alpha Level members.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.04,1:45:19.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心 人马上就到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, company's coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:42.77,1:45:43.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你收到我的花了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you get my flowers?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:46.66,1:45:48.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很高兴你能来 尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm glad you're here, Nick.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:48.04,1:45:48.94,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:50.33,1:45:52.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我以为是你杀了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cause I thought you had me killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.41,1:45:53.85,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道游戏规则的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know how the game works.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:54.83,1:45:56.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么让我做神盾局局长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why make me head of S.H.I.E.L.D?
Dialogue: 0,1:45:56.64,1:45:58.00,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你是我认识的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cause you're the best
Dialogue: 0,1:45:58.04,1:45:59.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最好的 最无情的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the most ruthless person I ever met.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:59.74,1:46:02.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是在尽力保护人民\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did what I did to protect people.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.19,1:46:05.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们的敌人就是你的敌人 尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our enemies are your enemies, Nick.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.08,1:46:08.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混乱 战争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Disorder, war.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.08,1:46:09.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脏弹袭击莫斯科\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's just a matter of time
Dialogue: 0,1:46:09.86,1:46:13.83,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者电磁脉冲瘫痪芝加哥只是迟早的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}before a dirty bomb goes off in Moscow, or an EMP fries Chicago.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.60,1:46:19.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠外交吗 治标不治本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Diplomacy? Holding action, a band-aid.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:20.47,1:46:23.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道我是在哪里想清楚的 波哥大(哥伦比亚城市)\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you know where I learned that: Bogota.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:25.12,1:46:27.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你没征求同意 而是做了该做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't ask, you just did what had to be done.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:28.99,1:46:33.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以让七十亿人获得秩序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can bring order to the lives of seven billion people
Dialogue: 0,1:46:34.18,1:46:36.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要牺牲两千万人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}by sacrificing twenty million.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:37.32,1:46:38.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你有胆量迈出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the next step, Nick,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:39.19,1:46:40.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是下一步 尼克\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you have the courage to take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:40.56,1:46:42.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不 我有胆量不迈出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I have the courage not to.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:47.30,1:46:49.61,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虹膜扫描开启\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Retinal scanner active.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:50.72,1:46:53.03,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以为我们不会取消你的权限吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't you think we wiped your clearance from the system?
Dialogue: 0,1:46:53.03,1:46:57.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道你删了我的密码 应该还有扫描记录\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know you erased my password, probably deleted my retinal scan,
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.56,1:47:01.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但如果你想先我一步 部长先生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but if you want to stay ahead of me, Mr. Secretary...
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.56,1:47:07.90,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就得瞪大两只眼睛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You need to keep both eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:12.16,1:47:14.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,A级人员确认\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alpha Level confirmed.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.20,1:47:17.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,加密解锁 保密协议取消\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Encryption code accepted. Safeguards removed.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:17.48,1:47:20.78,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,航母C在左前方45度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie Carrier's forty-five degrees off the port bow.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.66,1:47:27.73,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,六分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:27.73,1:47:29.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山姆 我需要搭个便车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Sam, I'm gonna need a ride.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:31.02,1:47:33.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到 准备好了通知我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Roger! Let me know when you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.22,1:47:36.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just did!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.18,1:47:56.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你比看起来重多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, you're a lot heavier than you look.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:56.63,1:47:57.95,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早饭吃多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I had a big breakfast.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:00.02,1:48:00.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,史蒂夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steve!
Dialogue: 0,1:48:31.72,1:48:33.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,队长 队长 回话 你还好吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cap? Cap, come in. Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.77,1:48:37.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,收到 我还在天空航母上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I'm here! I'm still on the Helicarrier.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.51,1:48:38.32,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在哪里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:38.33,1:48:42.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能飞了 战衣坏了 抱歉 队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm grounded, the suit's down. Sorry, Cap.
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.87,1:48:44.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别担心 我能行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't worry, I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:00.81,1:49:02.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,长官 理事会被控制了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, Council's been breached.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.09,1:49:04.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说详细情况\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Repeat dispatch.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:04.29,1:49:05.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,黑寡妇在上面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Black Widow's up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:05.83,1:49:06.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Headed up!
Dialogue: 0,1:49:09.43,1:49:10.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,猎鹰\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Falcon?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.29,1:49:10.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.90,1:49:12.48,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,朗姆洛往理事会方向去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rumlow's headed for the Council.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:12.48,1:49:13.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.36,1:49:25.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会有很多人丧命的 巴基\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}People are gonna die, Buck.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:27.62,1:49:29.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不能坐视不理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't let that happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:49:37.48,1:49:39.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,求你别逼我这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, don't make me do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.20,1:50:48.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(传输完成)
Dialogue: 0,1:50:48.81,1:50:49.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Done.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.10,1:50:52.25,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经成话题了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And it's trending.
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.74,1:51:01.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不想胸骨被烧出个两英寸的洞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unless you want two inch hole in your sternum,
Dialogue: 0,1:51:01.79,1:51:03.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就放下枪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd put that gun down.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:05.61,1:51:07.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一戴上 它就启动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That was armed the moment you pinned it on.
Dialogue: 0,1:51:41.08,1:51:41.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:51:43.03,1:51:43.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,松手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Drop it!
Dialogue: 0,1:52:04.35,1:52:05.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在41楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on forty-one,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:05.46,1:52:07.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正在朝西南楼梯井走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}headed towards the south-west stairwell.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:14.32,1:52:15.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要吃苦头了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is gonna hurt.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:17.24,1:52:19.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九头蛇不留囚犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are no prisoners with Hydra,
Dialogue: 0,1:52:19.24,1:52:20.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有秩序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}just order.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:20.55,1:52:22.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而只有经历痛苦 才有秩序\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And order only comes through pain.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.26,1:52:25.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好受苦了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ready for yours?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:25.40,1:52:26.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快闭嘴吧你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Man, shut the hell up.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:28.60,1:52:29.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中尉 还要多久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lieutenant, how much longer?
Dialogue: 0,1:52:29.68,1:52:31.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,65秒后接通卫星线路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sixty-five seconds to satellite link.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.89,1:52:35.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,重新确定目标 武器就绪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Target reengaged. Lowering weapons array now.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:39.30,1:52:40.17,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一分钟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:52:59.84,1:53:01.27,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,30秒 队长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thirty seconds, Cap!
Dialogue: 0,1:53:03.25,1:53:04.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand by.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:18.22,1:53:19.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高度已到达三千英尺\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've reached three thousand feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.50,1:53:22.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卫星系统上线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Satellite coming online now.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:24.12,1:53:25.64,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,运行算法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Deploy algorithm.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.07,1:53:26.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(获取目标)
Dialogue: 0,1:53:26.72,1:53:28.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算法已运行\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Algorithm deployed.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:29.06,1:53:30.84,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以获取目标了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are go to targets.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:35.83,1:53:36.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(已获取目标)
Dialogue: 0,1:53:37.12,1:53:37.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(马修·埃利斯总统 华盛顿特区)
Dialogue: 0,1:53:45.63,1:53:46.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(安托尼·斯塔克 纽约市)
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.05,1:53:49.30,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(已获取目标)
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.76,1:53:52.72,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标数量饱和 已分配完毕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Targets saturation reached. All targets assigned.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.80,1:53:54.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,随时可以开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire when ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.89,1:53:57.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备开火 三\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Firing in, three,
Dialogue: 0,1:53:59.43,1:54:00.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two,
Dialogue: 0,1:54:01.49,1:54:02.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}one.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:05.45,1:54:06.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,C船替换完成\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Charlie locked.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:06.86,1:54:10.69,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,目标呢 目标都去哪儿了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are the targets? Where are the targets?
Dialogue: 0,1:54:10.69,1:54:12.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 队长 离开那里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, Cap, get out of there.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:12.78,1:54:13.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(重定向)
Dialogue: 0,1:54:14.37,1:54:15.70,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(已获取目标)
Dialogue: 0,1:54:29.58,1:54:30.74,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开火吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire now.
Dialogue: 0,1:54:31.49,1:54:32.08,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是 史蒂夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But, Steve...
Dialogue: 0,1:54:32.08,1:54:34.46,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开火 现在就开火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it! Do it now!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:05.08,1:55:06.62,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是浪费\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a waste.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:06.64,1:55:09.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还怀疑罗杰斯会失败吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you still on the fence about Roger's chances?
Dialogue: 0,1:55:09.55,1:55:10.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该走了 女理事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time to go, Councilwoman.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:10.97,1:55:14.98,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边走 快点 你要带我飞离这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way, come on. You're gonna fly me out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:15.11,1:55:18.54,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,知道吗 我曾经愿意为你挡子弹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, there was a time I would have taken a bullet for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:55:18.54,1:55:21.58,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你已经挡过了 必要时你还会...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You already did. You will again when...
Dialogue: 0,1:55:25.14,1:55:26.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(正在重启)
Dialogue: 0,1:55:26.06,1:55:26.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(已启动)
Dialogue: 0,1:55:35.27,1:55:36.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罗曼诺夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Romanoff!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.34,1:55:38.37,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娜塔莎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Natasha!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:40.27,1:55:42.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,娜塔莎 醒醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Natasha, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:55:49.10,1:55:50.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那玩意还真疼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those really do sting.
Dialogue: 0,1:56:23.68,1:56:25.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九头蛇万岁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hail, Hydra.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:20.39,1:57:22.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你完全不是对手 小鬼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're out of your depth, kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:39.32,1:57:41.50,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托告诉我你开直升机过来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please, tell me you got that chopper in the air!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.50,1:57:43.06,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,山姆 你在哪\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:57:43.59,1:57:45.56,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,41楼 西北角\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}41st floor, north-west corner!
Dialogue: 0,1:57:45.56,1:57:47.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就来 待着别动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're on it, stay where you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:57:47.48,1:57:49.01,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not an option!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:03.07,1:58:05.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,41楼 41楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}41st floor! 41st!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.71,1:58:07.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们又没把楼层号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not like they put the floor numbers
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.24,1:58:09.18,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,标在大楼的外墙上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the outside of the building!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:10.57,1:58:13.81,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,希尔 史蒂夫呢 知道罗杰斯在哪吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hill, where's Steve? You got a location on Rogers?
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.49,1:58:30.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你认识我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know me.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.40,1:58:33.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不认识\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't!
Dialogue: 0,1:58:43.38,1:58:47.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,巴基 你从小就认识我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bucky, you've known me your whole life.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:54.96,1:58:59.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的名字是詹姆斯·布坎南·巴恩斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your name is James Buchanan Barnes.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:59.10,1:59:00.26,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.00,1:59:12.75,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是不会跟你打的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not gonna fight you.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:14.72,1:59:15.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:22.82,1:59:24.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是我的任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're my mission.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.97,1:59:33.13,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就完成任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then finish it.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:36.34,1:59:38.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为我会陪你走到最后的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cause I'm with you till the end of the line.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:30.22,2:01:35.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(马文·盖伊 《黑手煞星》)
Dialogue: 0,2:01:50.14,2:01:51.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在你左边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}On your left.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:10.88,2:02:13.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(斯塔克工业 人力资源部)
Dialogue: 0,2:02:50.03,2:02:52.36,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么现在还没有罗杰斯队长的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why haven't we yet heard from Captain Rogers?
Dialogue: 0,2:02:54.35,2:02:56.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不知道他还有什么可说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what's left for him to say.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.14,2:02:57.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我认为波托马克河\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think the rock in the middle of the
Dialogue: 0,2:02:57.96,2:02:59.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里的残骸已经表明了一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Potomac made his point fairly eloquently.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:59.68,2:03:01.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可以解释一下 这个国家该怎么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, he could explain how this country's expected
Dialogue: 0,2:03:01.89,2:03:04.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,维护自己的安全\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to maintain its national security now that
Dialogue: 0,2:03:04.47,2:03:08.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你们俩毁掉了我们的情报机构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he and you have laid waste our intelligence apparatus.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:08.42,2:03:10.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九头蛇卖给你们的是谎言 不是情报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hydra was selling you lies, not intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:10.49,2:03:13.52,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很多谎言还是出自你口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Many of which you seem to have had a personal hand in telling.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:13.52,2:03:15.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特工 你应该知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Agent, you should know that
Dialogue: 0,2:03:15.29,2:03:17.42,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,委员会中有些成员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there are some on this committee who feel,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:17.42,2:03:18.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,考虑到你既服务过这个国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}given your service record,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:18.93,2:03:21.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也背叛过这个国家\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}both for this country and against it,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:21.69,2:03:26.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你应该被监禁 而不是在国会山和我们顶嘴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you belong in a penitentiary, not mouthing off on Capitol Hill.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:27.60,2:03:29.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不会把我关进监狱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not gonna put me in a prison.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:29.85,2:03:34.51,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们不会把任何人关进去的 知道为什么吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not gonna put any of us in a prison. You know why?
Dialogue: 0,2:03:35.52,2:03:37.07,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请指点吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do enlighten us.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:37.13,2:03:38.66,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为你们需要我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because you need us.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:39.49,2:03:41.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 这个世界很脆弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, the world is a vulnerable place,
Dialogue: 0,2:03:42.05,2:03:44.04,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 我们对此负有责任\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and yes, we helped make it that way.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:44.82,2:03:47.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但我们也是最能保护它的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we're also the ones best qualified to defend it.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:49.13,2:03:51.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以你们要想逮捕我 就动手吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So if you want to arrest me, arrest me.
Dialogue: 0,2:03:52.27,2:03:53.67,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们知道去哪里找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'll know where to find me.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:29.40,2:04:32.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你经历过这种事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, you've experienced this sort of things before?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:32.91,2:04:34.11,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你会习惯的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You get used to it.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:34.32,2:04:36.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(尼古拉斯·J·弗瑞上校 正义之路...)
Dialogue: 0,2:04:34.32,2:04:36.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,2:04:36.82,2:04:38.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们挖掘了九头蛇的资料\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been data-mining Hydra's files.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:39.30,2:04:41.82,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来有很多漏网之鱼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks Like a lot of rats didn't go down with the ship.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:43.06,2:04:46.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今晚启程去欧洲 你要一起吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm heading to Europe tonight, wanted to ask if you'd come.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:47.87,2:04:49.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还有事要做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's something I gotta do first.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:50.30,2:04:53.35,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你呢 威尔逊 我需要有你这样本事的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How about you, Wilson? I could use a man with your abilities.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.88,2:04:55.91,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比起间谍 我更喜欢当士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm more of a soldier than a spy.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:56.77,2:04:57.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alright then.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:03.10,2:05:07.43,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要是有人问起我 让他们来这里找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anybody asks for me, tell them they can find me right here.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:09.10,2:05:09.65,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你该感到荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should be honored,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:09.65,2:05:12.29,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这在他这儿 是最接近"谢谢"的了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that's about as close as he gets to saying thank you.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:13.60,2:05:14.76,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不跟他一起吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not going with him?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:15.41,2:05:16.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:16.36,2:05:17.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也不留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not staying here?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:19.58,2:05:22.09,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的身份全都暴露了 我得去弄个新的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I blew all my covers, I gotta go figure out a new one.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:22.09,2:05:23.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那得花上一段时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That might take a while.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:23.50,2:05:24.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正好歇一阵子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm counting on it.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:27.22,2:05:28.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要的那个东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That thing you asked for,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:28.79,2:05:31.20,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找基辅的几个朋友帮了些忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I called in a few favors from Kiev.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:33.74,2:05:37.14,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算是帮我个忙 约那个护士吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Will you do me a favor? Call that nurse.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:37.27,2:05:38.40,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她不是护士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's not a nurse.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:38.40,2:05:40.31,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也不是神盾局特工\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're not a S.H.I.E.L.D agent.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:41.29,2:05:42.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,她叫什么来着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was her name again?
Dialogue: 0,2:05:42.34,2:05:45.39,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,莎伦 她很不错的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sharon. She's nice.
Dialogue: 0,2:05:57.67,2:05:58.80,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心点 史蒂夫\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be careful, Steve.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:00.26,2:06:02.21,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面的东西你要做好心理准备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You might not want to pull on that thread.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:13.58,2:06:14.60,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要去找他吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going after him?
Dialogue: 0,2:06:15.72,2:06:16.99,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不必跟我一起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't have to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:17.08,2:06:17.96,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:20.18,2:06:21.22,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么时候出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When do we start?
Dialogue: 0,2:08:15.83,2:08:17.87,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《美国队长2：冬日战士》
Dialogue: 0,2:08:20.73,2:08:21.77,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:22.22,2:08:24.49,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弗瑞将一切都公之于众了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fury has released everything to the public.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:25.21,2:08:26.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只公布了他知道的信息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Everything he knows about.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:26.97,2:08:28.92,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,斯特拉克先生 如果他们知道我们在这里做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mr. Strucker, if they get word of our work here,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:28.93,2:08:30.89,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果他们知道我们服务于九头蛇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if they find out we serve Hydra...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:30.89,2:08:33.16,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,九头蛇 神盾局\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hydra, S.H.I.E.L.D,
Dialogue: 0,2:08:33.70,2:08:37.10,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,两个都一样 现在都不行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}two sides of a coin that's no longer currency.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:40.35,2:08:41.79,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们拥有的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What we have
Dialogue: 0,2:08:43.96,2:08:46.41,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,价值是他们无法想象的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is worth more than any of them ever knew.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:49.16,2:08:52.71,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们只接触到了点皮毛 就已经...\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've only scratched the surface and already...
Dialogue: 0,2:08:55.70,2:09:00.02,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,世界上还有其他为九头蛇工作的机构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are other facilities doing Hydra's good work around the world.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:00.68,2:09:04.24,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全丢给美国队长和他那帮乱七八糟的朋友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We'll feed them to Captain America and his colorful friends.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:04.34,2:09:06.15,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,引开他们的注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep them off our scent.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:06.45,2:09:08.47,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那些志愿者呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the volunteers?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:08.77,2:09:10.63,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,死了的会被埋得很深\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dead will be buried so deep
Dialogue: 0,2:09:10.63,2:09:12.97,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们自己的魂魄都找不到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}their own ghosts won't be able to find them.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:14.87,2:09:16.19,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸存者呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And the survivors?
Dialogue: 0,2:09:18.30,2:09:19.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那对双胞胎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The twins.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:23.38,2:09:26.33,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们迟早要见见双胞胎\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sooner or later they will meet the twins.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:28.58,2:09:30.86,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这已经不是间谍的世界了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a world of spies anymore,
Dialogue: 0,2:09:30.86,2:09:32.44,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,甚至也不是英雄的世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not even a world of heroes.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:33.63,2:09:36.68,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是属于奇迹的时代 博士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is the age of miracles, doctor.
Dialogue: 0,2:09:38.24,2:09:43.45,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有什么比奇迹更恐怖了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's nothing more horrifying than a miracle.
Dialogue: 0,2:15:17.00,2:15:19.93,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(巴基·巴恩斯)
Dialogue: 0,2:15:44.53,2:15:48.12,*Default,NTP,0,0,0,,美国队长将在《复仇者联盟2：奥创纪元》中回归